1
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">DOCTOR WHO THEME</font>

2
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:35,600
<font color="#ffffff">VWORP! VWORP!</font>

3
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:30,800
<font color="#ffffff">THE DOCTOR: That Dalek got quite</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a beating, if I remember rightly.</font>

4
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,640
<font color="#ffff00">Professor!</font>

5
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:35,200
<font color="#ffffff">Ace!</font>

6
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:35,200
<font color="#ffffff">HE LAUGHS</font>

7
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:40,280
<font color="#ffffff">Ah-ha-ha, mine, I believe.</font>

8
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:44,440
<font color="#ffff00">Last time I saw you, you were</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a hologram.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Mm.</font><font color="#ffff00"> But you're here.</font>

9
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,080
<font color="#ffff00">You're real.</font>

10
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:52,520
<font color="#ffff00">You've got old.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Time streams are funny things.</font>

11
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">In some, I regenerate.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">In others, I don't.</font>

12
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,920
<font color="#ffffff">It's all a matter of perspective.</font>

13
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:02,960
<font color="#ffff00">I was in the middle of a meeting</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and then I was here.</font>

14
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:06,960
<font color="#ffffff">This is a Memory TARDIS.</font>

15
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:10,680
<font color="#ffffff">A special place</font>
<font color="#ffffff">where old friends come together</font>

16
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:14,960
<font color="#ffffff">to share stories, to remember!</font>

17
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:25,200
<font color="#ffffff">And to confront...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">difficult truths.</font>

18
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,160
<font color="#ffff00">Did you ever think of me?</font>

19
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:33,600
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Ace!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I thought about you every day.</font>

20
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:35,920
<font color="#ffff00">Sometimes I wish I'd never left.</font>

21
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:38,040
<font color="#ffff00">That I'd stayed with you forever.</font>

22
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:41,560
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, well, that's the thing, you see.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">This place,</font>

23
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,720
<font color="#ffffff">this IS forever.</font>

24
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:46,080
<font color="#ffffff">It's kept alive with memories</font>

25
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">and we stoke its engine</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with our stories.</font>

26
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:52,520
<font color="#ffffff">And we can return here</font>
<font color="#ffffff">whenever we like.</font>

27
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,200
<font color="#ffffff">With a wish.</font>

28
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:57,720
<font color="#ffff00">That's how I met you, remember?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">With a wish.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Mm.</font>

29
00:02:57,720 --> 00:03:01,360
<font color="#ffff00">I wished I was somewhere else.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Somewhere that wasn't Perivale.</font>

30
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:05,600
<font color="#ffff00">And then I was halfway</font>
<font color="#ffff00">across the universe.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Iceworld.</font>

31
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,840
<font color="#ffff00">Except it wasn't my choice,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">remember?</font>

32
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:15,400
<font color="#ffff00">I was taken there by Fenric.</font>

33
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:20,240
<font color="#ffff00">I was just a part</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of one of his games.</font>

34
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:23,320
<font color="#ffffff">A game of traps.</font>

35
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:25,880
<font color="#ffff00">I don't think I want to remember.</font>

36
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:34,480
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe you should.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe we both should.</font>

37
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:40,520
<font color="#ffff00">It's too much!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Our pain comes to</font>
<font color="#ffffff">define us, Ace. Alongside the joy.</font>

38
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:42,680
<font color="#ffff00">Good people died that day.</font>

39
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:46,920
<font color="#ffff00">So many lives were ruined.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Others were set in motion.</font>

40
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:48,960
<font color="#ffff00">Dangerous undercurrents.</font>

41
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:54,200
<font color="#ffffff">I taught you to dive beneath</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the surface, to be unafraid.</font>

42
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:56,480
<font color="#ffffff">So...</font>

43
00:03:56,480 --> 00:04:00,080
<font color="#ffffff">..let's dive together this time.</font>

44
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:06,040
<font color="#ffffff">Into the water.</font>

45
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:38,560
<font color="#ffffff">IN RUSSIAN:</font>

