00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:37,440
<font color="#ffffff">VWORP! VWORP!</font>

47
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:47,520
<font color="#ffffff">Ah! This looks about right.</font>

48
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:51,080
<font color="#ffffff">World War II uniforms. No need</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to worry about looking silly.</font>

49
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:53,720
<font color="#ffff00">If this is a top-secret naval camp,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">then I'm Lord Nelson.</font>

50
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, whine, whine, whine, whine.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Professor, top-secret naval camps</font>

51
