<font color="#00ffff">leaving the conservatory.</font>

54
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:10,640
<font color="#00ffff">Entering the library.</font>

55
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:15,080
<font color="#00ffff">Will reach the drawing room</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in about 60 seconds.</font>

56
