<font color="#ffff00">I've had more trouble getting into</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Greenford disco without a ticket.</font>

57
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:21,320
<font color="#ffffff">You can always go back.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'd rather go rock climbing.</font>

58
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:24,800
<font color="#ffffff">Not in those clothes. Ha ha ha!</font>

59
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:29,160
<font color="#00ffff">House guests leaving the nursery.</font>

60
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,840
<font color="#00ffff">Wait! Something's wrong.</font>

61
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:34,520
<font color="#00ffff">One of them's a girl!</font>

62
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:37,040
<font color="#ffffff">Say again.</font><font color="#00ffff"> One of them's a girl.</font>

63
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:39,040
<font color="#00ffff">They're the wrong ones.</font>

64
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:44,360
<font color="#ffffff">Rat Trap! Rat Trap! Now!</font>

65
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:51,320
<font color="#00ff00">Don't move! Hands up!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">About time, too!</font>

66
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:54,760
<font color="#ffffff">Call yourself Royal Marines? You're</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a disgrace. Those boots are filthy.</font>

67
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:57,120
<font color="#ffffff">What would happen if the Germans</font>
<font color="#ffffff">attacked now?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Sorry, sir.</font>

68
