70
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:04,360
<font color="#ffffff">I don't suppose you know</font>
<font color="#ffffff">where Dr Judson's office is?</font>

71
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,840
<font color="#ffffff">Never mind. This way.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yes, sir.</font>

72
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:33,080
<font color="#ffffff">HE SPEAKS RUSSIAN</font>

73
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:36,800
<font color="#00ffff">Prozorov, everything in English.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">From now on, everything in English.</font>

74
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:39,760
<font color="#00ff00">Quick. Down on the beach.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Come on!</font><font color="#ffffff"> How long till nightfall?</font>

75
