<font color="#00ffff">Long enough. Come on!</font>

76
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:52,160
<font color="#00ffff">Gayev, listen to me.</font>

77
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:54,960
<font color="#00ffff">Where are the sealed orders?</font>

78
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:58,600
<font color="#00ffff">You had them.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Gayev, what's happened to them?</font>

79
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,840
<font color="#00ffff">Gayev!</font>

80
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:03,240
<font color="#00ffff">Let's take him to the camp.</font>

81
