82
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:10,960
<font color="#00ffff">Move, move, move!</font>

83
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:12,960
<font color="#ffffff">FIRM KNOCK ON DOOR</font>

84
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:16,040
<font color="#00ffff">In heaven's name!</font><font color="#ffffff"> You must be</font>
