85
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:19,000
<font color="#ffffff">I've travelled a long way</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to meet you.</font><font color="#00ffff"> This is intolerable!</font>

86
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,000
