87
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,520
<font color="#00ff00">Remember your blood pressure.</font>

88
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:25,800
<font color="#ffffff">The Prisoner's Dilemma.</font><font color="#00ff00"> You can't</font>
<font color="#00ff00">just...</font><font color="#00ffff"> Oh, shut up, Crane!</font>

89
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:28,280
<font color="#00ffff">You're familiar</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with the Prisoner's Dilemma, then?</font>

90
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:30,360
<font color="#ffffff">Based on a false premise,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">don't you think?</font>

91
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:34,680
<font color="#ffffff">Like all zero-sum games. But a neat</font>
<font color="#ffffff">algorithm, nevertheless, Dr Judson.</font>

92
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:37,320
<font color="#ffffff">Excuse me. Do you have any official</font>
<font color="#ffffff">stationery and a typewriter?</font>

93
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:42,200
<font color="#00ffff">Uh, on the desk. You're obviously</font>
<font color="#00ffff">also an expert in this field,</font>

94
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:45,600
<font color="#00ffff">but I'm afraid I don't recognise...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Ace.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Hi. I'm Ace.</font>

95
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:49,280
<font color="#ffff00">And this is the Professor.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Doctor.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Sorry, Doctor.</font>

96
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:51,360
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, wow!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Have you seen this, Professor?</font>

97
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:54,280
<font color="#00ffff">Put it down, child! It's not a toy!</font>

98
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:57,960
<font color="#ffff00">I know it's not. It's a flip-flop</font>
<font color="#ffff00">thingy. We used them at school.</font>

99
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,560
<font color="#00ffff">You understand it?</font>

100
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:02,960
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah. It's a logic game, isn't it?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Drop marbles in the top</font>

101
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:05,240
<font color="#ffff00">and depending on what colour</font>
<font color="#ffff00">each window is,</font>

102
