103
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:09,360
<font color="#ffff00">You've got a logic diagram for it</font>
<font color="#ffff00">on the blackboard.</font>

104
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:13,040
<font color="#00ffff">This is extraordinary. And you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">learnt about logic at school?</font>

105
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:15,040
<font color="#ffff00">Miss Birkett taught us</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in Computer Studies.</font>

106
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:20,120
<font color="#ffff00">She was well good. Can I borrow</font>
<font color="#ffff00">this?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Two pens, please.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Crane!</font>

107
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,520
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, thank you.</font>

108
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:30,400
<font color="#ffffff">KNOCK ON DOOR</font>

109
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:30,400
<font color="#ffffff">There we are. Come in!</font>

110
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,400
<font color="#00ff00">I'm sorry to disturb you, sir,</font>

111
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,840
<font color="#00ff00">but these two</font>
