115
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:49,440
<font color="#00ff00">I must apologise, sir. We weren't</font>
<font color="#00ff00">informed of your arrival.</font>

116
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,320
<font color="#ffffff">Need to know, Captain. Need to know.</font>

117
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:54,800
<font color="#ffffff">Dr Judson's work</font>
<font color="#ffffff">at breaking the German codes</font>

118
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,920
<font color="#ffffff">is very important to the war effort.</font>

119
00:09:56,920 --> 00:10:00,320
<font color="#00ff00">We thought you were something to do</font>
<font color="#00ff00">with those East End kids. Evacuees.</font>

120
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:02,840
<font color="#ffff00">I'm not from the East End. I'm</font>
<font color="#ffff00">from...</font><font color="#00ffff"> Perhaps you'd like to see</font>

121
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:05,040
<font color="#00ffff">the Ultima machine?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The Ultima machine? Yes!</font>

122
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:07,360
<font color="#00ffff">Bates, go and fetch</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Commander Millington, will you?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Sir!</font>

123
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:09,800
<font color="#ffffff">On second thoughts, it's been</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a tiring day. Perhaps tomorrow,</font>

124
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:12,000
<font color="#ffffff">Dr Judson. If you'd just show us</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to our quarters,</font>

125
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:14,000
<font color="#ffffff">that would be very good.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font>

126
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:21,400
<font color="#00ffff">Now, as soon as it's dark,</font>
