<font color="#00ffff">in case anything gets washed up.</font>

128
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:28,960
<font color="#ffffff">Alone?</font><font color="#00ffff"> It only needs one.</font>

129
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:31,960
<font color="#ffffff">You listen to me. There's evil here.</font>

130
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:34,600
<font color="#ffffff">Can't you feel it?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Cold against our skin.</font>

131
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,840
<font color="#00ffff">Stop it!</font>

132
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:40,320
<font color="#00ffff">More stupid Armenian superstitions.</font>

133
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:43,320
<font color="#00ffff">You're supposed to be a soldier.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">So was he!</font>

134
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:45,400
<font color="#00ffff">You follow orders.</font>

135
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:48,840
<font color="#ffff00">Ace! Bunk beds! Bags I go on top.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Quiet, Ace.</font>

136
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:51,120
<font color="#ffffff">People are trying to sleep.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Sorry.</font>

137
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:00,320
<font color="#ffff00">Is it all right if I go down</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to the cliffs tomorrow</font>

138
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:04,440
<font color="#ffff00">and do some rock climbing?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Go to sleep.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Sorry.</font>

139
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:19,480
<font color="#ffff00">Night.</font>

140
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:23,240
<font color="#ffff00">Where are you off to?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Night air. Go to sleep!</font>

141
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:37,360
<font color="#ffffff">BABY CRIES</font>

142
00:13:07,040 --> 00:13:11,760
<font color="#00ff00">Ah! Oh, it's you, sir.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Thank goodness. I thought...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Eyes.</font>

143
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:13,400
<font color="#ffffff">Eyes watching.</font>

144
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:40,880
<font color="#ffffff">Aaaargh!</font>

145
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:44,880
<font color="#ffff00">Wonderful service.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Thank you</font>
<font color="#00ff00">so much. What a lovely day.</font>

146
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:48,320
<font color="#00ff00">Miss Hardaker.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Your sermon, Mr Wainwright.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Yes?</font>

147
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:50,640
<font color="#00ffff">There's no doubt about it,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Mr Wainwright.</font>

148
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:55,120
<font color="#00ffff">Of course, we'll win the war.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Right is on our side.</font>

149
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:59,720
<font color="#00ff00">I don't think that right is on</font>
<font color="#00ff00">anyone's side in war, Miss Hardaker.</font>

150
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:04,120
<font color="#00ffff">Your father would turn in his grave</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to hear such words!</font>

151
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:08,080
<font color="#00ffff">When he was vicar of this parish,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">there was respect for the Good Book.</font>

152
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:11,160
<font color="#00ff00">I think that faith</font>
<font color="#00ff00">is more than just words.</font>

153
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:14,920
<font color="#00ffff">In plain language,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">doubt and indecision.</font>

154
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:17,200
<font color="#00ff00">Miss Hardaker...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Pardon me.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I wonder if you could help me.</font>

155
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:19,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm looking for Dr Judson.</font>

156
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:21,320
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, I think you'll find him</font>
<font color="#00ff00">still working in the crypt.</font>

157
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:25,960
<font color="#00ff00">If you'd like to follow me.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Good day, Miss Hardaker. This way.</font>

158
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:30,520
<font color="#ffff00">Who's the old gargoyle?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Friend of yours?</font>

159
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:33,560
<font color="#00ffff">She's the old bag we've been</font>
<font color="#00ffff">billeted with.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Come again?</font>

160
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:35,480
<font color="#00ffff">We've been evacuated.</font>
