161
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:38,680
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, so am I...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Come along,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">girls! Time we were moving.</font>

162
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:41,080
<font color="#ffff00">OK, see you later.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Where?</font>

163
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:43,960
<font color="#ffff00">What about over there?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Maidens' Point.</font>

164
