<font color="#ffff00">And the half-time score -</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Perivale, six hundred million,</font>

670
00:49:56,760 --> 00:50:00,120
<font color="#ffff00">rest of the Universe, nil.</font>

671
00:50:04,000 --> 00:50:08,040
<font color="#ffffff">GLOOMY CLASSICAL MUSIC</font>

672
00:50:13,840 --> 00:50:15,680
<font color="#ffff00">No...</font>

673
00:50:15,680 --> 00:50:17,920
<font color="#ffff00">No... No...</font>

674
00:50:17,920 --> 00:50:20,280
<font color="#ffff00">No, I beg you... No!</font>

675
00:50:20,280 --> 00:50:21,960
<font color="#ffffff">SHE SCREAMS</font>

676
00:50:39,640 --> 00:50:42,440
<font color="#ffffff">Hello? Anybody home?</font>

677
00:50:47,440 --> 00:50:50,480
<font color="#ffffff">NEEDLE SCRAPES RECORD</font>

678
00:50:58,720 --> 00:50:59,880
<font color="#ffff00">Professor...</font>

679
00:51:02,920 --> 00:51:06,720
<font color="#ffffff">Just like the one at Maidens' Point,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">completely drained of blood.</font>

680
00:51:12,240 --> 00:51:14,440
<font color="#00ff00">I know who you are.</font>

681
00:51:14,440 --> 00:51:16,240
<font color="#00ffff">You've always known us.</font>

682
00:51:20,240 --> 00:51:24,480
<font color="#00ff00">But vampires</font>
<font color="#00ff00">are just superstition! Why?</font>

683
00:51:24,480 --> 00:51:28,360
<font color="#00ffff">We have black hearts. We were lost</font>
<font color="#00ffff">on the day we were born.</font>

684
00:51:28,360 --> 00:51:31,480
<font color="#00ff00">That's not true. No-one is lost.</font>

685
00:51:31,480 --> 00:51:33,320
<font color="#ffff00">Everyone is lost.</font>

686
00:51:35,480 --> 00:51:37,600
<font color="#00ff00">No further.</font>

687
00:51:37,600 --> 00:51:40,440
<font color="#00ff00">This is holy.</font>

688
00:51:40,440 --> 00:51:42,000
<font color="#00ff00">It will destroy you.</font>

689
00:51:42,000 --> 00:51:45,960
<font color="#ffff00">Objects can't harm us.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">It's human belief.</font>

690
00:51:45,960 --> 00:51:48,400
<font color="#ffff00">And you stopped believing</font>
<font color="#ffff00">when the bombs started falling.</font>

691
00:51:48,400 --> 00:51:51,000
<font color="#00ff00">I'm not frightened of German bombs.</font>

692
00:51:51,000 --> 00:51:54,000
<font color="#00ffff">Not German bombs. British.</font>

693
00:51:54,000 --> 00:51:58,840
<font color="#ffff00">On German cities. British bombs</font>
<font color="#ffff00">killing German children.</font>

694
00:51:58,840 --> 00:52:01,040
<font color="#00ff00">No.</font>

695
00:52:01,040 --> 00:52:04,320
<font color="#00ff00">No!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Stop!</font><font color="#ffff00"> What's happened to you?!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What are you doing?!</font>

696
00:52:04,320 --> 00:52:07,400
<font color="#00ffff">You should have</font>
<font color="#00ffff">come into the water with us.</font>

697
00:52:07,400 --> 00:52:10,640
<font color="#00ffff">Then we'd have been together.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Go!</font>

698
00:52:10,640 --> 00:52:12,320
<font color="#ffffff">Go.</font>

699
00:52:12,320 --> 00:52:13,800
<font color="#00ffff">We go...</font>

700
00:52:15,880 --> 00:52:18,320
<font color="#00ffff">..but we'll return for you,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Wainwright.</font>

701
00:52:30,360 --> 00:52:31,840
<font color="#00ffff">This is it, Judson!</font>

702
00:52:31,840 --> 00:52:34,960
<font color="#ffff00">A little respect for the wheelchair,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">please, Commander! He's an invalid.</font>

703
00:52:34,960 --> 00:52:37,760
<font color="#00ff00">I'm not an invalid,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I'm a cripple. I'm also a genius.</font>

704
00:52:37,760 --> 00:52:39,240
<font color="#00ff00">So shut up, the pair of you.</font>

705
00:52:39,240 --> 00:52:41,320
<font color="#00ffff">All that remains is the flask.</font>

706
00:52:41,320 --> 00:52:43,480
<font color="#00ffff">The machine can unlock its secrets.</font>

707
00:52:49,720 --> 00:52:53,200
<font color="#00ff00">We must tell Commander Millington.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">No, that's exactly what we won't do.</font>

708
00:52:53,200 --> 00:52:55,120
<font color="#ffffff">He'll just go around</font>
<font color="#ffffff">shooting everything.</font>

709
00:52:55,120 --> 00:52:58,120
<font color="#ffffff">As long as Dr Judson doesn't work</font>
<font color="#ffffff">out what the inscription is,</font>

710
00:52:58,120 --> 00:53:01,240
<font color="#ffffff">it'll keep them out of harm's way.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">He's a typical blinkered scientist.</font>

711
00:53:01,240 --> 00:53:03,000
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, no.</font>

712
00:53:03,000 --> 00:53:04,800
<font color="#ffff00">You should have told me!</font>

713
00:53:04,800 --> 00:53:06,600
<font color="#ffffff">Quick! We'd better stop them!</font>

714
00:53:09,360 --> 00:53:12,680
<font color="#00ff00">Now then, Millington.</font>

715
00:53:12,680 --> 00:53:14,520
<font color="#00ff00">Let's see, shall we?</font>

716
00:53:14,520 --> 00:53:16,000
<font color="#00ffff">Yes. Quick!</font>

717
00:53:50,600 --> 00:53:54,880
<font color="#00ffff">What does it mean?</font><font color="#00ff00"> I don't know!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">But you built the damn machine!</font>

718
00:53:54,880 --> 00:53:58,960
<font color="#00ff00">It's running at four times</font>
<font color="#00ff00">maximum speed! It's impossible!</font>

719
00:54:12,800 --> 00:54:16,160
<font color="#ffffff">Stop the machine!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Get out of here!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">You've got to stop the machine!</font>

720
00:54:16,160 --> 00:54:18,880
<font color="#00ff00">I can't!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Ace, the power!</font>

721
00:54:19,960 --> 00:54:21,920
<font color="#ffff00">It's stuck!</font>

722
00:54:21,920 --> 00:54:24,760
<font color="#ffffff">Pull it, pull it!</font><font color="#ffff00"> I can't!</font>

723
00:54:21,920 --> 00:54:24,760
<font color="#ffffff">MACHINE WHIRS</font>

724
00:54:24,760 --> 00:54:26,640
<font color="#00ffff">You're too late, Doctor!</font>

725
00:54:31,560 --> 00:54:34,760
<font color="#00ffff">Captain, no-one is to touch</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the Ultima machine.</font>

726
00:54:34,760 --> 00:54:37,640
<font color="#00ffff">It must complete its task.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Just one problem.</font>

727
00:54:37,640 --> 00:54:39,680
<font color="#ffffff">You've weakened</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the bases' defences precisely</font>

728
00:54:39,680 --> 00:54:43,480
<font color="#ffffff">so some Russians could steal it.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Captain, radio for reinforcements.</font>

729
00:54:43,480 --> 00:54:46,560
<font color="#00ff00">Sir, you've just ordered that all</font>
<font color="#00ff00">radio transmitters be disabled.</font>

730
00:54:46,560 --> 00:54:49,560
<font color="#00ff00">I've just set Perkins onto it now.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">What?!</font>

731
00:55:01,360 --> 00:55:03,360
<font color="#ffff00">Sir. Radio transmitters disabled,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">as ordered, sir.</font>

732
00:55:03,360 --> 00:55:07,280
<font color="#ffffff">Splendid work, Perkins! Splendid!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Now put them back together again.</font>

733
00:55:11,760 --> 00:55:15,120
<font color="#ffffff">We haven't got much time.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">But Jean and Phyllis...</font>

734
00:55:15,120 --> 00:55:16,960
<font color="#00ff00">Dark legends.</font>

735
00:55:16,960 --> 00:55:19,960
<font color="#00ff00">In the story of Dracula,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">this is where he came ashore.</font>

736
00:55:19,960 --> 00:55:23,760
<font color="#ffff00">Vampires?</font><font color="#ffffff"> No, haemovores. They are</font>
<font color="#ffffff">what Homo sapiens evolve into</font>

737
00:55:23,760 --> 00:55:25,360
<font color="#ffffff">thousands of years in the future.</font>

738
00:55:25,360 --> 00:55:28,960
<font color="#ffffff">Creatures with an insatiable hunger</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for blood.</font><font color="#00ff00"> I don't understand.</font>

739
00:55:28,960 --> 00:55:31,240
<font color="#00ff00">The future? How can you know?</font>

740
00:55:31,240 --> 00:55:33,880
<font color="#ffffff">I've seen it. How good are</font>
<font color="#ffffff">your parish records?</font>

741
00:55:33,880 --> 00:55:36,160
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, they go back</font>
<font color="#00ff00">as far as the 18th century.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Good!</font>

742
00:55:36,160 --> 00:55:37,960
<font color="#ffffff">Now for a little local history.</font>

743
00:55:39,520 --> 00:55:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">What's the matter?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I was just thinking.</font>

744
00:55:42,080 --> 00:55:45,920
<font color="#ffff00">If these vampires, I mean</font>
<font color="#ffff00">haemovores, if they come here,</font>

745
00:55:45,920 --> 00:55:48,240
<font color="#ffff00">well, Kathleen and her baby.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Look, once upon a time</font>

746
00:55:48,240 --> 00:55:50,640
<font color="#ffffff">you'd have dropped everything</font>
<font color="#ffffff">just for a little bit of excitement.</font>

747
00:55:50,640 --> 00:55:53,520
<font color="#ffff00">I just want to make sure</font>
<font color="#ffff00">they're all right.</font>

748
00:55:53,520 --> 00:55:56,040
<font color="#ffffff">Catch us up.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Thanks.</font>

749
00:55:57,400 --> 00:56:02,040
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor, those two girls.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">They said they'd come back for me.</font>

750
00:56:02,040 --> 00:56:05,680
<font color="#ffffff">Do you want to stay here?</font><font color="#00ff00"> No.</font>

751
00:56:05,680 --> 00:56:11,640
<font color="#00ff00">No, no, I can't.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Come, Doctor, the parish records.</font>

752
00:56:21,000 --> 00:56:23,080
<font color="#00ffff">I'm sorry, Capitan.</font>

753
00:56:23,080 --> 00:56:26,200
<font color="#00ffff">I know you and the sergeant</font>
<font color="#00ffff">had been friends a long time.</font>

754
00:56:33,480 --> 00:56:35,760
<font color="#00ffff">On your command!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Save your bullets.</font>

755
00:56:35,760 --> 00:56:38,520
<font color="#00ff00">Everyone pulls back, and don't</font>
<font color="#00ff00">turn away from them or you're dead.</font>

756
00:56:38,520 --> 00:56:41,200
<font color="#00ff00">Take him. Come on! Move, move!</font>

757
00:56:50,840 --> 00:56:52,760
<font color="#ffff00">Hi! How's the little horror?</font>

758
00:56:52,760 --> 00:56:56,720
<font color="#00ffff">I've just fed her and put her down.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, sorry.</font>

759
00:56:56,720 --> 00:56:58,360
<font color="#ffff00">You should have told me.</font>

760
00:56:58,360 --> 00:57:00,760
<font color="#ffffff">BABY GURGLES</font>

761
00:57:02,600 --> 00:57:05,440
<font color="#ffff00">Where will you go?</font><font color="#00ffff"> I'll manage.</font>

762
00:57:05,440 --> 00:57:09,800
<font color="#00ffff">Frank's got shore leave in a few</font>
<font color="#00ffff">weeks.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Who's Frank? Your boyfriend?</font>

763
00:57:09,800 --> 00:57:13,360
<font color="#00ffff">No, my husband!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I didn't know you were married.</font>

764
00:57:13,360 --> 00:57:15,960
<font color="#00ffff">I've got a baby!</font><font color="#ffff00"> I just thought...</font>

765
00:57:15,960 --> 00:57:18,360
<font color="#00ffff">Well, you can stop thinking it,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">all right?</font>

766
00:57:18,360 --> 00:57:20,320
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I didn't know...</font>

767
00:57:20,320 --> 00:57:23,360
<font color="#00ffff">It's OK. It's OK.</font>

768
00:57:25,200 --> 00:57:30,400
<font color="#ffff00">Where is he?</font><font color="#00ffff"> In the Merchant Navy.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Atlantic convoys.</font>

769
00:57:30,400 --> 00:57:33,920
<font color="#ffff00">I used to think</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'll never get married.</font>

770
00:57:35,160 --> 00:57:37,920
<font color="#ffff00">But now I'm not so sure.</font>

771
00:57:37,920 --> 00:57:42,520
<font color="#ffff00">There's a lot of things I'm not</font>
<font color="#ffff00">sure about now.</font><font color="#00ffff"> It's the war, Ace.</font>

772
00:57:42,520 --> 00:57:46,600
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah. Look, take care, won't you?</font>

773
00:57:46,600 --> 00:57:49,280
<font color="#00ffff">Thanks, you too.</font>

774
00:57:49,280 --> 00:57:52,600
<font color="#ffff00">No, I mean really take care.</font>

775
00:57:55,160 --> 00:57:57,560
<font color="#00ff00">We're wasting our time</font>
<font color="#00ff00">on some superstition.</font>

776
00:57:57,560 --> 00:58:02,240
<font color="#00ffff">The Viking legends will come true.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">The treasure will be brought to us.</font>

777
00:58:02,240 --> 00:58:05,960
<font color="#00ffff">And with it all the dark powers</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of Fenric shall be ours.</font>

778
00:58:05,960 --> 00:58:08,560
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, yes, I know.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Let the chains of Fenric shatter.</font>

779
00:58:08,560 --> 00:58:10,760
<font color="#00ff00">What about MY chains?!</font>

780
00:58:10,760 --> 00:58:12,680
<font color="#00ffff">That was over 20 years ago!</font>

781
00:58:12,680 --> 00:58:17,400
<font color="#00ffff">Why must you remind me?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I offer you EVERYTHING!</font>

782
00:58:26,360 --> 00:58:30,920
<font color="#ffff00">Capitan, what are they?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Six months</font>
<font color="#ffffff">ago, a small sabotage team</font>

783
00:58:30,920 --> 00:58:35,600
<font color="#ffffff">was sent into German-occupied</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Romania. Only one survived.</font>

784
00:58:35,600 --> 00:58:40,080
<font color="#ffffff">He talked about dead men</font>
<font color="#ffffff">coming out of a black fog.</font>

785
00:58:40,080 --> 00:58:41,960
<font color="#ffffff">The official report said</font>

786
00:58:41,960 --> 00:58:46,000
<font color="#ffffff">he'd been listening to too much</font>
<font color="#ffffff">local gossip about vampires.</font>

787
00:58:46,000 --> 00:58:47,960
<font color="#ffff00">But vampires don't exist.</font>

788
00:58:49,360 --> 00:58:51,040
<font color="#ffffff">Of course not.</font>

789
00:58:57,920 --> 00:59:00,240
<font color="#ffff00">Why does your bell tower</font>
<font color="#ffff00">look like a fortress?</font>

790
00:59:00,240 --> 00:59:02,760
<font color="#ffff00">Like the people who built it</font>
<font color="#ffff00">were expecting trouble.</font>

791
00:59:02,760 --> 00:59:05,400
<font color="#00ff00">I don't think there's a record</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of any battles taking place here.</font>

792
00:59:05,400 --> 00:59:08,360
<font color="#ffffff">Today's events haven't been written</font>
<font color="#ffffff">down yet. Now, you're looking for</font>

793
00:59:08,360 --> 00:59:11,040
<font color="#ffffff">the descendants of the early Viking</font>
<font color="#ffffff">settlers about 200 years ago.</font>

794
00:59:11,040 --> 00:59:12,680
<font color="#ffffff">Ace, you help me.</font>

795
00:59:23,680 --> 00:59:27,000
<font color="#ffff00">So, what exactly are we looking for?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The Viking inscriptions said</font>

796
00:59:27,000 --> 00:59:30,040
<font color="#ffffff">they were carrying treasures</font>
<font color="#ffffff">from the Orient.</font>

797
00:59:30,040 --> 00:59:33,600
<font color="#ffff00">Give me SOMETHING to go on.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">A few hints might be useful.</font>

798
00:59:33,600 --> 00:59:36,680
<font color="#ffffff">Just look for something evil!</font>

799
00:59:51,640 --> 00:59:54,040
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor! Doctor!</font>

800
01:00:02,400 --> 01:00:04,240
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor!</font>

801
01:00:04,240 --> 01:00:06,720
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor, I've found it!</font>

802
01:00:06,720 --> 01:00:09,600
<font color="#00ff00">Exactly as you said!</font><font color="#ffff00"> What you got?</font>

803
01:00:09,600 --> 01:00:13,920
<font color="#00ff00">There's your Vikings,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">or descendants of them at any rate.</font>

804
01:00:13,920 --> 01:00:16,600
<font color="#00ff00">"Joseph Sundvik.</font>

805
01:00:16,600 --> 01:00:19,040
<font color="#00ff00">"Florence Sundvik, wife.</font>

806
01:00:19,040 --> 01:00:23,600
<font color="#00ff00">"Daughters, Sarah,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Martha, Jane, Clara, Annie."</font>

807
01:00:23,600 --> 01:00:27,160
<font color="#ffffff">The Curse of Fenric,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">passed down through the generations.</font>

808
01:00:59,200 --> 01:01:02,520
<font color="#ffffff">Find out which daughters married,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and what their new surnames are.</font>

809
01:01:02,520 --> 01:01:05,720
<font color="#ffff00">Professor?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What's this water doing here?</font>

810
01:01:05,720 --> 01:01:08,120
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, it's the roof. It leaks.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">It always seeps in like that</font>

811
01:01:08,120 --> 01:01:10,080
<font color="#00ff00">when it's raining</font>
<font color="#00ff00">and there's an east wind.</font>

812
01:01:10,080 --> 01:01:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">The problem is, it's not raining.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">There's a west wind.</font>

813
01:01:12,560 --> 01:01:14,840
<font color="#ffffff">THEY SHOUT</font>

814
01:01:21,280 --> 01:01:23,960
<font color="#ffff00">Argh! Argh!</font>

815
01:01:25,800 --> 01:01:27,200
<font color="#ffff00">Argh!</font>

816
01:03:03,880 --> 01:03:05,320
<font color="#ffff00">Get off!</font>

817
01:03:15,880 --> 01:03:17,200
<font color="#00ffff">Follow me!</font>

818
01:03:41,560 --> 01:03:44,440
<font color="#00ffff">Takes two against one, does it?!</font>

819
01:03:45,520 --> 01:03:48,040
<font color="#00ffff">How about a little Cossack blood?!</font>

820
01:03:51,520 --> 01:03:53,000
<font color="#00ffff">Fire!</font>

821
01:03:55,200 --> 01:03:57,080
<font color="#00ffff">Up the ladder, quick!</font>

822
01:04:09,160 --> 01:04:10,640
<font color="#00ffff">Quick!</font>

823
01:04:12,920 --> 01:04:14,680
<font color="#ffffff">Hold them!</font>

824
01:04:14,680 --> 01:04:16,800
<font color="#00ff00">I don't know that I can!</font>

825
01:04:16,800 --> 01:04:20,640
<font color="#ffffff">You've got to have faith!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Have faith. Faith. Faith.</font>

826
01:04:20,640 --> 01:04:22,680
<font color="#ffffff">HE MUTTERS</font>

827
01:04:22,680 --> 01:04:26,720
<font color="#ffffff">ANGELIC SINGING</font>

828
01:04:33,760 --> 01:04:35,800
<font color="#ffffff">HE MUTTERS INAUDIBLY</font>

829
01:04:35,800 --> 01:04:40,520
<font color="#ffffff">ANGELIC MELODY CONTINUES</font>

830
01:04:40,520 --> 01:04:42,560
<font color="#ffffff">GUNFIRE</font>

831
01:04:50,840 --> 01:04:53,240
<font color="#00ffff">We won't have</font>
<font color="#00ffff">any more trouble from those two.</font>

832
01:04:53,240 --> 01:04:55,080
<font color="#00ffff">Quick, up the ladder.</font>

833
01:05:04,000 --> 01:05:06,000
<font color="#ffffff">Ah. Any more up there?</font>

834
01:05:06,000 --> 01:05:08,920
<font color="#00ffff">Only those creatures.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Quick, you and</font>
<font color="#ffffff">your men, down to the crypt.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Down.</font>

835
01:05:08,920 --> 01:05:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">Get the record books.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Right!</font>

836
01:05:11,280 --> 01:05:13,240
<font color="#ffffff">Hurry up!</font><font color="#00ff00"> Yes!</font>

837
01:05:18,040 --> 01:05:19,520
<font color="#ffffff">Jam the door!</font>

838
01:05:21,040 --> 01:05:24,000
<font color="#ffff00">That noise you were making,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">like singing, only it wasn't.</font>

839
01:05:24,000 --> 01:05:26,440
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, just a little something</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to frighten off haemovores.</font>

840
01:05:26,440 --> 01:05:28,640
<font color="#ffff00">I thought vampires were scared</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of crucifixes.</font><font color="#ffffff"> No, no,</font>

841
01:05:28,640 --> 01:05:31,080
<font color="#ffffff">it's not the crucifix that frightens</font>
<font color="#ffffff">them, it's the faith of the person</font>

842
01:05:31,080 --> 01:05:33,520
<font color="#ffffff">carrying it. It creates a psychic</font>
<font color="#ffffff">barrier, just like I did.</font>

843
01:05:33,520 --> 01:05:34,840
<font color="#00ffff">Door's secure.</font>

844
01:05:34,840 --> 01:05:38,080
<font color="#00ff00">We're trapped!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Ace?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">The mineshaft!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Correct!</font>

845
01:05:40,000 --> 01:05:42,760
<font color="#00ffff">Listen, I must go back to my men.</font>

846
01:05:42,760 --> 01:05:47,080
<font color="#00ff00">You can't go back that way!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Those creatures, they're inhuman!</font>

847
01:05:47,080 --> 01:05:50,560
<font color="#00ffff">I must try. If I fail, I fail.</font>

848
01:05:50,560 --> 01:05:52,040
<font color="#00ffff">These two will stay with you.</font>

849
01:05:52,040 --> 01:05:55,560
<font color="#ffff00">Professor, show him</font>
<font color="#ffff00">how to make the singing.</font><font color="#ffffff"> I can't.</font>

850
01:05:55,560 --> 01:05:57,840
<font color="#ffffff">Either he believes absolutely,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">or he doesn't.</font>

851
01:05:57,840 --> 01:06:01,440
<font color="#00ffff">I believe in the Revolution.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Complete faith? No doubts?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Go.</font>

852
01:06:01,440 --> 01:06:05,040
<font color="#00ffff">If we meet again,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you will have your answer.</font>

853
01:06:22,000 --> 01:06:23,080
<font color="#00ffff">Be careful.</font>

854
01:06:27,560 --> 01:06:29,240
<font color="#ffffff">I hope we're not too late.</font>

855
01:06:29,240 --> 01:06:31,600
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, no!</font><font color="#00ff00"> What's happened?</font>

856
01:06:31,600 --> 01:06:34,240
<font color="#ffffff">You two, break that wall down.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Quick, quick!</font>

857
01:06:37,480 --> 01:06:40,320
<font color="#ffff00">If you want a job doing properly,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">get a girl to do it.</font>

858
01:06:40,320 --> 01:06:43,720
<font color="#ffff00">Out of the way, boys.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Ace!</font>

859
01:06:43,720 --> 01:06:45,920
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, don't antagonise her.</font>

860
01:06:45,920 --> 01:06:48,640
<font color="#ffffff">You'll only make things worse.</font>

861
01:06:50,040 --> 01:06:53,120
<font color="#ffff00">Five seconds and you're yesterday's</font>
<font color="#ffff00">breakfast, sunbeam.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Take cover!</font>

862
01:06:59,680 --> 01:07:01,360
<font color="#ffff00">Wicked!</font>

863
01:07:05,120 --> 01:07:07,120
<font color="#ffffff">Quick! Into the tunnel!</font>

864
01:07:10,400 --> 01:07:12,400
<font color="#ffffff">I'll talk to you later!</font>

865
01:07:23,440 --> 01:07:25,040
<font color="#ffffff">ANGELIC ARIA</font>

866
01:07:25,040 --> 01:07:28,080
<font color="#ffffff">TERRIFIED SHRIEKING</font>

867
01:07:31,760 --> 01:07:33,480
<font color="#ffff00">How much further?</font>

868
01:07:33,480 --> 01:07:38,040
<font color="#ffffff">300 or 400 metres.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, we'll never make it.</font>

869
01:07:38,040 --> 01:07:40,400
<font color="#ffffff">What's the matter?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Well, if I get the top off this,</font>

870
01:07:40,400 --> 01:07:42,000
<font color="#ffff00">then I can make up some more nitro.</font>

871
01:07:42,000 --> 01:07:44,800
<font color="#ffffff">Another explosion might bring</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the roof down on top of our heads.</font>

872
01:07:44,800 --> 01:07:47,400
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, just a small one.</font><font color="#ffffff"> No!</font>

873
01:07:47,400 --> 01:07:51,760
<font color="#00ff00">If only we could slow them down</font>
<font color="#00ff00">for a few moments.</font>

874
01:07:51,760 --> 01:07:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">GUNS CLICK</font>

875
01:07:54,880 --> 01:07:57,440
<font color="#ffffff">Two minutes...then follow us.</font>

876
01:08:02,880 --> 01:08:06,480
<font color="#ffffff">Where did you find that?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">It was just lying around.</font>

877
01:08:06,480 --> 01:08:11,840
<font color="#ffffff">That's the oriental treasure</font>
<font color="#ffffff">we've been looking for!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Oh...</font>

878
01:08:11,840 --> 01:08:15,880
<font color="#ffffff">ANGELIC ARIA AND TERRIFIED SHRIEKING</font>

879
01:08:55,400 --> 01:08:58,640
<font color="#ffffff">What's happening?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The air is so still, so warm.</font>

880
01:09:00,360 --> 01:09:03,000
<font color="#ffff00">There is a storm coming on.</font>

881
01:09:06,160 --> 01:09:08,280
<font color="#ffffff">MILLINGTON:</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Come on, you're almost here!</font>

882
01:09:10,400 --> 01:09:11,680
<font color="#00ffff">Come on!</font>

883
01:09:15,280 --> 01:09:17,720
<font color="#00ffff">Right, seal it.</font><font color="#ffffff"> But there are</font>
<font color="#ffffff">two people following us.</font>

884
01:09:17,720 --> 01:09:19,920
<font color="#00ffff">You're here,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that's all I'm interested in</font>

885
01:09:19,920 --> 01:09:22,880
<font color="#00ffff">And I'll have those.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Open this door!</font>

886
01:09:22,880 --> 01:09:26,040
<font color="#00ffff">Many years ago, when I was</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Chief Petty Officer on board ship,</font>

887
01:09:26,040 --> 01:09:28,000
<font color="#00ffff">we had an explosion</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in an engine room.</font>

888
01:09:28,000 --> 01:09:30,640
<font color="#ffffff">But the Russians are our friends,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">our allies!</font><font color="#00ffff"> We had to seal it off</font>

889
01:09:30,640 --> 01:09:34,040
<font color="#00ffff">to save the ship, keep the flames</font>
<font color="#00ffff">restricted to one section.</font>

890
01:09:34,040 --> 01:09:36,560
<font color="#00ff00">Please, Commander.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Those two men won't stand a chance</font>

891
01:09:36,560 --> 01:09:39,960
<font color="#00ff00">against those creatures.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">They're inhuman!</font><font color="#ffff00"> So's he.</font>

892
01:09:39,960 --> 01:09:44,120
<font color="#00ffff">We could hear men screaming behind</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the bulkhead for nearly an hour,</font>

893
01:09:44,120 --> 01:09:46,560
<font color="#00ffff">and then the screaming stopped.</font>

894
01:09:55,320 --> 01:10:00,040
<font color="#ffffff">You stay here. If I'm not back</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in ten minutes, abort the mission.</font>

895
01:10:02,760 --> 01:10:04,160
<font color="#ffffff">Take cover.</font>

896
01:10:09,920 --> 01:10:11,560
<font color="#ffffff">Commander Millington!</font>

897
01:10:13,000 --> 01:10:16,960
<font color="#ffffff">Commander Millington!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I want to talk with you!</font>

898
01:10:16,960 --> 01:10:19,440
<font color="#ffffff">Officer to officer!</font>

899
01:10:19,440 --> 01:10:21,280
<font color="#00ff00">Here we are, Judson.</font>

900
01:10:21,280 --> 01:10:23,160
<font color="#00ff00">I said it would be brought to us.</font>

901
01:10:23,160 --> 01:10:24,920
<font color="#00ff00">Release the power.</font>

902
01:10:27,000 --> 01:10:30,000
<font color="#ffffff">Sir, the house guests have arrived.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">What?</font>

903
01:10:30,000 --> 01:10:34,160
<font color="#ffffff">The house guests. There's one</font>
<font color="#ffffff">outside. He wants to talk to you.</font>

904
01:10:34,160 --> 01:10:35,640
<font color="#00ff00">Talk?!</font>

905
01:10:40,320 --> 01:10:43,440
<font color="#ffffff">We must talk, Commander Millington.</font>

906
01:10:45,360 --> 01:10:48,440
<font color="#00ff00">I'm afraid you have me</font>
<font color="#00ff00">at a disadvantage.</font>

907
01:10:48,440 --> 01:10:52,920
<font color="#00ff00">You seem to know my name,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">but I don't know yours.</font>

908
01:10:52,920 --> 01:10:57,000
<font color="#00ff00">However, that hardly</font>
<font color="#00ff00">seems to matter at the moment.</font>

909
01:10:57,000 --> 01:11:00,640
<font color="#00ff00">You will tell your men to put down</font>
<font color="#00ff00">their weapons and surrender.</font>

910
01:11:00,640 --> 01:11:02,120
<font color="#ffffff">I come alone.</font>

911
01:11:07,760 --> 01:11:10,320
<font color="#ffffff">Very well.</font>

912
01:11:10,320 --> 01:11:14,080
<font color="#ffffff">Lay down your weapons</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and come in peacefully!</font>

913
01:11:16,040 --> 01:11:18,160
<font color="#ffffff">Like the wolves of winter!</font>

914
01:11:19,720 --> 01:11:22,760
<font color="#ffff00">Come on, pull back! Move it!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Let's get out of here!</font>

915
01:11:25,840 --> 01:11:29,000
<font color="#00ff00">Lock him up!</font>

916
01:11:29,000 --> 01:11:31,720
<font color="#00ff00">You'll be pleased to know, Doctor,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">everything is under control.</font>

917
01:11:31,720 --> 01:11:34,080
<font color="#ffffff">The Russians aren't your</font>
<font color="#ffffff">problem, those creatures are!</font>

918
01:11:34,080 --> 01:11:36,280
<font color="#ffffff">They devour humans</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the way you eat fruit.</font>

919
01:11:36,280 --> 01:11:39,560
<font color="#00ff00">I doubt if any creatures</font>
<font color="#00ff00">can walk through iron shutters.</font>

920
01:11:39,560 --> 01:11:43,280
<font color="#ffffff">They can weld metal beneath</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the sea, with their bare hands!</font>

921
01:11:49,440 --> 01:11:51,160
<font color="#ffff00">You all right?</font>

922
01:11:53,760 --> 01:11:55,960
<font color="#ffff00">What is it?</font>

923
01:11:55,960 --> 01:11:59,360
<font color="#ffff00">What's wrong? Tell me!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What's the matter? I'll do anything!</font>

924
01:12:01,760 --> 01:12:03,400
<font color="#ffff00">What's this?</font>

925
01:12:07,400 --> 01:12:11,920
<font color="#ffff00">"It is with deepest sorrow</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that I write to inform you</font>

926
01:12:11,920 --> 01:12:16,280
<font color="#ffff00">"that the ship on which your</font>
<font color="#ffff00">husband, Frank Dudman, was serving</font>

927
01:12:16,280 --> 01:12:19,560
<font color="#ffff00">"was struck by enemy torpedoes.</font>

928
01:12:19,560 --> 01:12:22,600
<font color="#ffff00">"Your husband</font>
<font color="#ffff00">was trapped in the fire,</font>

929
01:12:22,600 --> 01:12:26,960
<font color="#ffff00">"and has been listed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">as missing, presumed dead.</font>

930
01:12:26,960 --> 01:12:30,040
<font color="#ffff00">"Please accept</font>
<font color="#ffff00">our sincere condolences..."</font>

931
01:12:33,440 --> 01:12:35,360
<font color="#ffff00">I'm sorry.</font>

932
01:12:47,080 --> 01:12:51,240
<font color="#ffff00">You know what's going on,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">don't you?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes.</font><font color="#ffff00"> You always know.</font>

933
01:12:51,240 --> 01:12:53,960
<font color="#ffff00">You just can't be bothered</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to tell anyone!</font>

934
01:12:53,960 --> 01:12:57,480
<font color="#ffff00">It's like it's some kind of a game</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and only you know the rules.</font>

935
01:12:57,480 --> 01:13:00,120
<font color="#ffff00">You knew all about that inscription</font>
<font color="#ffff00">being a computer programme,</font>

936
01:13:00,120 --> 01:13:01,760
<font color="#ffff00">but you didn't tell me.</font>

937
01:13:01,760 --> 01:13:05,520
<font color="#ffff00">You know all about that old bottle,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and you're not telling me.</font>

938
01:13:05,520 --> 01:13:07,840
<font color="#ffff00">Am I so stupid?</font><font color="#ffffff"> No, that's not it.</font>

939
01:13:07,840 --> 01:13:09,960
<font color="#ffff00">Why then?! I want to know!</font>

940
01:13:09,960 --> 01:13:13,040
<font color="#ffffff">Evil. Evil, since the dawn of time!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What do you mean?</font>

941
01:13:13,040 --> 01:13:15,240
<font color="#ffffff">Will you stop asking me these</font>
<font color="#ffffff">questions?!</font><font color="#ffff00"> TELL ME!</font>

942
01:13:15,240 --> 01:13:17,360
<font color="#ffffff">The dawn of time.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The beginning of all beginnings.</font>

943
01:13:17,360 --> 01:13:19,240
<font color="#ffffff">Two forces only, good and evil.</font>

944
01:13:19,240 --> 01:13:22,040
<font color="#ffffff">Then chaos - time is born,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">matter, space.</font>

945
01:13:22,040 --> 01:13:24,840
<font color="#ffffff">The universe cries out</font>
<font color="#ffffff">like a newborn.</font>

946
01:13:24,840 --> 01:13:28,560
<font color="#ffffff">The forces shatter</font>
<font color="#ffffff">as the universe explodes outwards.</font>

947
01:13:28,560 --> 01:13:34,440
<font color="#ffffff">Only echoes remain, and yet somehow,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">somehow the evil force survives.</font>

948
01:13:34,440 --> 01:13:38,120
<font color="#ffffff">An intelligence. Pure evil!</font>

949
01:13:38,120 --> 01:13:39,680
<font color="#ffff00">And that's Fenric?</font>

950
01:13:39,680 --> 01:13:43,040
<font color="#ffffff">No! That's just</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Millington's name for it.</font>

951
01:13:43,040 --> 01:13:44,600
<font color="#ffffff">Evil has no name.</font>

952
01:13:44,600 --> 01:13:48,080
<font color="#ffffff">Trapped inside a flask.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Like a genie in a bottle.</font>

953
01:13:48,080 --> 01:13:51,800
<font color="#ffff00">Can we stop it?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We need to get that flask.</font>

954
01:13:53,560 --> 01:13:57,560
<font color="#ffff00">We can release Captain Sorin to</font>
<font color="#ffff00">help us. I can distract the guard.</font>

955
01:13:57,560 --> 01:14:01,840
<font color="#ffffff">How?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Professor,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'm not a little girl.</font>

956
01:14:16,760 --> 01:14:19,440
<font color="#00ff00">You looking for someone?</font><font color="#ffff00"> No.</font>

957
01:14:20,640 --> 01:14:22,000
<font color="#ffff00">You.</font>

958
01:14:38,000 --> 01:14:40,240
<font color="#ffff00">There's a wind whipping up.</font>

959
01:14:40,240 --> 01:14:43,000
<font color="#ffff00">I can feel it through my clothes.</font>

960
01:14:43,000 --> 01:14:47,200
<font color="#ffff00">Is there a storm coming?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I wasn't expecting one.</font>

961
01:14:47,200 --> 01:14:49,920
<font color="#ffff00">Question is -</font>

962
01:14:49,920 --> 01:14:52,880
<font color="#ffff00">is he making all the right moves...</font>

963
01:14:52,880 --> 01:14:55,080
<font color="#ffff00">..or only going through the motions?</font>

964
01:15:22,840 --> 01:15:25,720
<font color="#00ff00">What are you doing here?</font>

965
01:15:25,720 --> 01:15:28,760
<font color="#ffff00">You have to move faster than that</font>
<font color="#ffff00">if you want to keep up with me.</font>

966
01:15:28,760 --> 01:15:32,840
<font color="#ffff00">Faster than light.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Faster</font>
<font color="#00ff00">than the second hand on a watch?</font>

967
01:15:32,840 --> 01:15:34,760
<font color="#ffff00">Much faster.</font>

968
01:15:34,760 --> 01:15:36,520
<font color="#ffff00">We're not even moving yet.</font>

969
01:15:37,640 --> 01:15:40,600
<font color="#ffff00">Hardly cruising speed.</font>

970
01:15:40,600 --> 01:15:44,960
<font color="#ffff00">Sometimes...I move so fast...</font>

971
01:15:44,960 --> 01:15:47,040
<font color="#ffff00">..I don't exist any more.</font>

972
01:15:49,400 --> 01:15:50,880
<font color="#00ff00">What can you see?</font>

973
01:15:55,200 --> 01:16:00,920
<font color="#ffff00">Undercurrents.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Bringing things to the surface.</font>

974
01:16:00,920 --> 01:16:03,800
<font color="#ffff00">I can't stay!</font><font color="#00ff00"> You promised.</font>

975
01:16:03,800 --> 01:16:05,280
<font color="#ffff00">I can't!</font>

976
01:16:10,000 --> 01:16:11,520
<font color="#00ff00">I'm here.</font>

977
01:16:16,600 --> 01:16:19,720
<font color="#00ffff">The Book won't do you any good.</font>

978
01:16:19,720 --> 01:16:21,440
<font color="#00ffff">You don't BELIEVE.</font>

979
01:16:21,440 --> 01:16:24,000
<font color="#00ff00">We'll see.</font>

980
01:16:24,000 --> 01:16:26,360
<font color="#ffffff">ANGELIC ARIA</font>

981
01:16:26,360 --> 01:16:30,840
<font color="#ffffff">THEY SCREAM</font>

982
01:16:36,680 --> 01:16:39,480
<font color="#ffffff">You all right?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yeah,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">nothing out of my depth.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Come on.</font>

983
01:16:39,480 --> 01:16:42,240
<font color="#ffff00">How are we going to stop Fenric?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Evil needs a body.</font>

984
01:16:42,240 --> 01:16:44,120
<font color="#ffffff">It hasn't found one yet.</font>

985
01:16:45,560 --> 01:16:48,360
<font color="#ffff00">It's not true! You don't believe it!</font>

986
01:16:48,360 --> 01:16:50,960
<font color="#00ffff">Look at us. There's no good in us.</font>

987
01:16:50,960 --> 01:16:55,000
<font color="#00ff00">No! I believe in good!</font>

988
01:16:56,440 --> 01:16:59,720
<font color="#ffff00">Look at yourself...</font>
<font color="#ffff00">There's no good in you.</font>

989
01:16:59,720 --> 01:17:02,920
<font color="#ffffff">SINGING WEAKENS</font>

990
01:16:59,720 --> 01:17:02,920
<font color="#00ff00">No... No...</font>

991
01:17:02,920 --> 01:17:05,320
<font color="#00ff00">No! NO!</font>

992
01:17:05,320 --> 01:17:07,480
<font color="#00ff00">N-o-o-o-o-o!</font>

993
01:17:16,840 --> 01:17:18,320
<font color="#00ffff">What's it doing?!</font>

994
01:17:18,320 --> 01:17:22,160
<font color="#00ffff">Argh!</font>

995
01:17:36,560 --> 01:17:39,400
<font color="#ffffff">Don't touch him! Don't touch</font>
<font color="#ffffff">anything!</font><font color="#00ffff"> He's an invalid!</font>

996
01:17:39,400 --> 01:17:42,000
<font color="#00ffff">He can't even stand</font>
<font color="#00ffff">without someone to support him.</font>

997
01:17:42,000 --> 01:17:43,520
<font color="#ffffff">He's dead.</font>

998
01:17:43,520 --> 01:17:45,880
<font color="#00ff00">The time is now.</font>

999
01:17:45,880 --> 01:17:48,560
<font color="#00ff00">The chains of Fenric are shattered.</font>

1000
01:17:49,960 --> 01:17:52,360
<font color="#00ff00">The gods have</font>
<font color="#00ff00">lost the final battle.</font>

1001
01:17:52,360 --> 01:17:54,000
<font color="#ffff00">We're too late. It's him!</font>

1002
01:17:54,000 --> 01:17:58,080
<font color="#00ff00">The dead men's ship</font>
<font color="#00ff00">has slipped its mooring.</font>

1003
01:17:58,080 --> 01:18:01,560
<font color="#00ff00">And the Great Ash itself</font>
<font color="#00ff00">trembles to its roots!</font>

1004
01:18:04,120 --> 01:18:06,160
<font color="#00ff00">Fenric...</font>

1005
01:18:13,040 --> 01:18:17,680
<font color="#00ffff">We play the contest again...</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Time Lord.</font>

1006
01:18:24,480 --> 01:18:27,080
<font color="#00ffff">You left me</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in the Shadow Dimensions.</font>

1007
01:18:27,080 --> 01:18:31,760
<font color="#00ffff">Trapped for 17 centuries.</font>

1008
01:18:31,760 --> 01:18:33,800
<font color="#00ffff">But now...</font>

1009
01:18:33,800 --> 01:18:36,800
<font color="#00ffff">..I've found a body again.</font>

1010
01:18:36,800 --> 01:18:41,360
<font color="#00ffff">And the preparations are complete.</font>

1011
01:18:52,160 --> 01:18:54,000
<font color="#00ff00">Shoot them!</font>

1012
01:18:54,000 --> 01:18:57,880
<font color="#ffffff">What for?!</font><font color="#00ff00"> Because</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I order you to! For treason!</font>

1013
01:18:57,880 --> 01:18:59,360
<font color="#ffffff">Sir.</font>

1014
01:19:10,040 --> 01:19:12,760
<font color="#00ffff">I was only expecting one.</font>

1015
01:19:17,920 --> 01:19:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">You don't have to kill her!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Let's just get this over with.</font>

1016
01:19:22,240 --> 01:19:25,000
<font color="#00ffff">Ready!</font><font color="#ffffff"> She's only a child!</font>

1017
01:19:25,000 --> 01:19:27,520
<font color="#00ffff">Aim!</font><font color="#00ff00"> Killing us</font>
<font color="#00ff00">doesn't make any difference!</font>

1018
01:19:27,520 --> 01:19:29,040
<font color="#ffff00">Mum, I'm sorry!</font>

1019
01:19:32,000 --> 01:19:34,240
<font color="#00ffff">Grenade! Take cover!</font>

1020
01:19:50,960 --> 01:19:52,200
<font color="#00ff00">Give me your gun!</font>

1021
01:19:54,240 --> 01:19:58,880
<font color="#ffffff">I was hoping for something</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a little more, well...Aryan.</font>

1022
01:20:00,040 --> 01:20:03,280
<font color="#ffffff">However,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">let the Ancient One approach.</font>

1023
01:20:04,520 --> 01:20:06,760
<font color="#ffffff">Where is the Ancient One?</font>

1024
01:20:06,760 --> 01:20:10,000
<font color="#ffff00">He waits.</font><font color="#ffffff"> He waits? He waits?</font>

1025
01:20:10,000 --> 01:20:13,920
<font color="#ffffff">What for?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Has he no sense of occasion?</font>

1026
01:20:13,920 --> 01:20:17,040
<font color="#ffffff">I want him here...now.</font>

1027
01:20:17,040 --> 01:20:18,720
<font color="#00ffff">As you command.</font>

1028
01:20:43,000 --> 01:20:45,800
<font color="#ffffff">SOLDIERS SCREAM</font>

1029
01:20:50,000 --> 01:20:54,000
<font color="#ffffff">What did you say over there?</font><font color="#ffff00"> What?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Over there. You said something.</font>

1030
01:20:54,000 --> 01:20:56,600
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, nothing. Just...</font>

1031
01:20:56,600 --> 01:20:58,640
<font color="#ffff00">Just something.</font>

1032
01:20:58,640 --> 01:21:00,720
<font color="#ffffff">You mentioned your mum.</font>

1033
01:21:00,720 --> 01:21:03,680
<font color="#ffff00">Don't play games with me, Doctor.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We're all playing games.</font>

1034
01:21:03,680 --> 01:21:06,000
<font color="#ffffff">Fenric's games.</font>

1035
01:21:06,000 --> 01:21:08,560
<font color="#ffffff">We're playing his games</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and falling into his traps.</font>

1036
01:21:11,760 --> 01:21:15,320
<font color="#00ff00">And the battlefield</font>
<font color="#00ff00">shall stretch 100 leagues.</font>

1037
01:21:15,320 --> 01:21:20,480
<font color="#00ff00">And at the end of the day, not one</font>
<font color="#00ff00">living thing shall be left alive.</font>

1038
01:21:20,480 --> 01:21:23,600
<font color="#00ff00">The ancient enemies</font>
<font color="#00ff00">shall seek each other out</font>

1039
01:21:23,600 --> 01:21:25,920
<font color="#00ff00">and all shall die!</font>

1040
01:21:25,920 --> 01:21:29,000
<font color="#ffffff">I must play the game</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to the end this time.</font>

1041
01:21:29,000 --> 01:21:31,480
<font color="#ffff00">What game?</font>

1042
01:21:31,480 --> 01:21:34,480
<font color="#ffffff">A very simple game.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The game of chess.</font>

1043
01:21:34,480 --> 01:21:38,000
<font color="#00ffff"># When the bough breaks</font>

1044
01:21:38,000 --> 01:21:41,040
<font color="#00ffff"># The cradle will fall</font>

1045
01:21:41,040 --> 01:21:44,200
<font color="#00ffff"># Down will come baby</font>

1046
01:21:44,200 --> 01:21:48,080
<font color="#00ffff"># Cradle and all</font>

1047
01:21:50,480 --> 01:21:51,920
<font color="#00ffff"># And all... #</font>

1048
01:21:53,320 --> 01:21:56,080
<font color="#00ff00">Move it! Move it!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I need a chess set to play the game.</font>

1049
01:21:56,080 --> 01:21:58,920
<font color="#ffffff">I need pieces.</font><font color="#ffff00"> If we can get</font>
<font color="#ffff00">into Commander Millington's office,</font>

1050
01:21:58,920 --> 01:22:02,360
<font color="#ffff00">we can nick his chess set.</font><font color="#00ff00"> We came</font>
<font color="#00ff00">here to steal Ultima machine.</font>

1051
01:22:02,360 --> 01:22:05,440
<font color="#00ff00">Chess set? No problem. Follow me.</font>

1052
01:22:11,040 --> 01:22:16,320
<font color="#00ffff">How English.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Everything stops for tea.</font>

1053
01:22:16,320 --> 01:22:20,960
<font color="#00ffff">Fetch me the Ancient One.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">There is much to do.</font>

1054
01:22:34,560 --> 01:22:37,840
<font color="#00ff00">We've got a clear path</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to the British positions. Go!</font>

1055
01:22:41,760 --> 01:22:46,000
<font color="#00ffff">Establish new positions.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Secure the laboratory.</font>

1056
01:22:46,000 --> 01:22:47,280
<font color="#00ff00">Follow me!</font>

1057
01:22:51,600 --> 01:22:53,760
<font color="#ffff00">You are summoned.</font>

1058
01:22:53,760 --> 01:22:56,480
<font color="#ffffff">BOTH: You must obey.</font>

1059
01:23:23,440 --> 01:23:25,360
<font color="#00ffff">Ah.</font>

1060
01:23:25,360 --> 01:23:28,760
<font color="#00ffff">The sound of dying.</font>

1061
01:23:28,760 --> 01:23:31,280
<font color="#00ffff">When it comes to death,</font>

1062
01:23:31,280 --> 01:23:36,000
<font color="#00ffff">quantity is so much more satisfying</font>
<font color="#00ffff">than quality.</font>

1063
01:23:36,000 --> 01:23:39,440
<font color="#00ff00">The final...</font><font color="#00ffff"> Don't interrupt me</font>
<font color="#00ffff">when I'm eulogising.</font>

1064
01:23:39,440 --> 01:23:43,360
<font color="#00ffff">Where is the Time Lord?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Time Lord?</font>

1065
01:23:43,360 --> 01:23:47,040
<font color="#00ffff">The one you call Doctor.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I had him shot.</font>

1066
01:23:47,040 --> 01:23:51,000
<font color="#00ffff">I can see you've never been</font>
<font color="#00ffff">handicapped by great intelligence.</font>

1067
01:23:51,000 --> 01:23:55,000
<font color="#00ffff">For 17 centuries, I was trapped</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in the Shadow Dimensions</font>

1068
01:23:55,000 --> 01:23:58,400
<font color="#00ffff">because of him. He pulled bones</font>
<font color="#00ffff">from the desert sands</font>

1069
01:23:58,400 --> 01:23:59,880
<font color="#00ffff">and carved them into chess pieces.</font>

1070
01:23:59,880 --> 01:24:04,520
<font color="#00ffff">He challenged me</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to solve his puzzle. I failed.</font>

1071
01:24:04,520 --> 01:24:09,120
<font color="#00ffff">Now I shall see him</font>
<font color="#00ffff">kneel before me...</font>

1072
01:24:09,120 --> 01:24:11,480
<font color="#00ffff">..before I let him die.</font>

1073
01:24:22,840 --> 01:24:24,240
<font color="#ffffff">Ready.</font>

1074
01:24:29,280 --> 01:24:30,520
<font color="#ffffff">Now!</font>

1075
01:24:34,840 --> 01:24:40,240
<font color="#ffffff">THEY COUGH</font>

1076
01:24:55,400 --> 01:24:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">Are they Russians?</font>

1077
01:24:57,000 --> 01:25:01,120
<font color="#00ff00">Russians, German, British.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">They're enemy.</font>

1078
01:25:03,840 --> 01:25:06,920
<font color="#ffff00">Here's the chess set.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">No, no! Don't touch!</font>

1079
01:25:08,320 --> 01:25:11,240
<font color="#ffff00">Ah...</font>

1080
01:25:08,320 --> 01:25:11,240
<font color="#ffffff">ACE COUGHS</font>

1081
01:25:14,520 --> 01:25:18,480
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, thanks. I don't know why he used</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a chemical grenade. If I was him,</font>

1082
01:25:18,480 --> 01:25:21,880
<font color="#ffff00">I'd have stuck a few sticks</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of explosives under the table.</font>

1083
01:25:24,160 --> 01:25:27,840
<font color="#ffffff">TIMER TICKS</font>

1084
01:25:35,960 --> 01:25:40,000
<font color="#00ffff">At last,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">another of the Wolves of Fenric</font>

1085
01:25:40,000 --> 01:25:42,920
<font color="#00ffff">decides to show up</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and play his role.</font>

1086
01:25:42,920 --> 01:25:46,760
<font color="#00ff00">My world is dead.</font>

1087
01:25:46,760 --> 01:25:49,200
<font color="#00ffff">Hardly a great loss,</font>

1088
01:25:49,200 --> 01:25:52,000
<font color="#00ffff">if you're the best</font>
<font color="#00ffff">evolution can manage.</font>

1089
01:25:52,000 --> 01:25:54,520
<font color="#00ffff">This is the 20th century.</font>

1090
01:25:54,520 --> 01:25:59,760
<font color="#00ffff">It doesn't become your world</font>
<font color="#00ffff">for a long time yet. First...</font>

1091
01:25:59,760 --> 01:26:04,280
<font color="#00ffff">..you must kill all the humans.</font>

1092
01:26:04,280 --> 01:26:06,000
<font color="#ffffff">Another of Fenric's traps.</font>

1093
01:26:06,000 --> 01:26:09,000
<font color="#ffff00">Well, at least I managed to grab</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the consolation prize.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Well done.</font>

1094
01:26:09,000 --> 01:26:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">The parish records. Great.</font>

1095
01:26:11,000 --> 01:26:14,560
<font color="#ffff00">What I can't understand is what's</font>
<font color="#ffff00">so special about them?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Names.</font>

1096
01:26:14,560 --> 01:26:17,240
<font color="#ffff00">Whose names?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Names of ancient families.</font>

1097
01:26:17,240 --> 01:26:19,920
<font color="#ffffff">Judson. Millington.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Wainwright. Dudman.</font>

1098
01:26:19,920 --> 01:26:22,920
<font color="#ffff00">Dudman! Kathleen Dudman,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">she's got a chess set.</font><font color="#ffffff"> No, no, no.</font>

1099
01:26:22,920 --> 01:26:25,600
<font color="#ffffff">Millington destroyed them all.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">No, no. I saw it in her suitcase.</font>

1100
01:26:25,600 --> 01:26:27,160
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font>

1101
01:26:37,640 --> 01:26:41,040
<font color="#00ff00">We are...the last two.</font>

1102
01:26:41,040 --> 01:26:44,680
<font color="#ffffff">This isn't war! This is massacre!</font>

1103
01:26:44,680 --> 01:26:48,000
<font color="#00ff00">The Ultima machine has done this.</font>

1104
01:26:48,000 --> 01:26:49,440
<font color="#ffffff">Destroy it.</font>

1105
01:26:53,040 --> 01:26:54,600
<font color="#00ff00">Go that way.</font>

1106
01:26:59,840 --> 01:27:01,800
<font color="#ffffff">WOMAN SCREAMS</font>

1107
01:27:01,800 --> 01:27:04,560
<font color="#00ff00">Your creatures are killing my men!</font>

1108
01:27:05,920 --> 01:27:07,440
<font color="#00ff00">What is it?</font>

1109
01:27:09,640 --> 01:27:12,720
<font color="#00ffff">We call him the Great Serpent.</font>

1110
01:27:12,720 --> 01:27:15,760
<font color="#00ff00">And the Great Serpent</font>
<font color="#00ff00">shall rise from the sea</font>

1111
01:27:15,760 --> 01:27:19,000
<font color="#00ff00">and spew venom over all the Earth.</font>

1112
01:27:19,000 --> 01:27:24,000
<font color="#00ffff">There's enough poison in here</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to contaminate the world...</font>

1113
01:27:24,000 --> 01:27:25,640
<font color="#00ffff">..forever.</font>

1114
01:27:32,880 --> 01:27:34,680
<font color="#00ff00">They're insane.</font>

1115
01:27:34,680 --> 01:27:37,520
<font color="#00ff00">They're trying to control the world</font>
<font color="#00ff00">with chemical weapons.</font>

1116
01:27:37,520 --> 01:27:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">All part of Fenric's evil game,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">no doubt. Like this weather.</font><font color="#00ff00"> I know.</font>

1117
01:27:44,000 --> 01:27:46,040
<font color="#00ff00">Let's join forces.</font>

1118
01:27:46,040 --> 01:27:50,600
<font color="#00ff00">Fight the real enemy.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">That's a really good idea.</font>

1119
01:27:50,600 --> 01:27:53,840
<font color="#ffff00">So we're...</font>
<font color="#ffff00">we're all on the same side, then?</font>

1120
01:27:55,240 --> 01:27:58,440
<font color="#00ffff">You have the spirit of a fighter.</font>

1121
01:27:58,440 --> 01:28:01,760
<font color="#00ffff">And you wear our emblem.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, it's not a real one.</font>

1122
01:28:01,760 --> 01:28:03,880
<font color="#ffff00">I bought it cheap in a market.</font>

1123
01:28:05,640 --> 01:28:07,280
<font color="#00ffff">Have the real one.</font>

1124
01:28:12,960 --> 01:28:14,440
<font color="#00ffff">Tovarich.</font>

1125
01:28:16,440 --> 01:28:19,680
<font color="#ffffff">Come on! We've got to get</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Kathleen's chess set. Come on!</font>

1126
01:28:23,720 --> 01:28:26,280
<font color="#ffff00">It's all right, girls!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">We'll take over now!</font>

1127
01:28:36,800 --> 01:28:39,840
<font color="#ffffff">HE SCREAMS</font>

1128
01:28:43,360 --> 01:28:45,760
<font color="#ffffff">The chess set!</font><font color="#ffff00"> In the suitcase!</font>

1129
01:28:49,280 --> 01:28:51,120
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, don't leave me!</font>

1130
01:28:51,120 --> 01:28:53,320
<font color="#ffff00">I can't leave them. I'll stay here.</font>

1131
01:28:53,320 --> 01:28:54,800
<font color="#ffffff">Well, don't leave the hut!</font>

1132
01:29:12,320 --> 01:29:14,520
<font color="#00ffff">You don't have the emblem this time.</font>

1133
01:29:15,920 --> 01:29:18,000
<font color="#00ff00">But I still have my faith</font>

1134
01:29:19,440 --> 01:29:23,480
<font color="#ffffff">ANGELIC ARIA</font>

1135
01:29:26,280 --> 01:29:29,320
<font color="#ffffff">THEY SHRIEK</font>

1136
01:29:42,280 --> 01:29:44,520
<font color="#ffff00">We've got to do something</font>
<font color="#ffff00">about this room.</font><font color="#00ffff"> All right.</font>

1137
01:29:44,520 --> 01:29:46,360
<font color="#00ffff">Let me just put the baby down, OK?</font>

1138
01:29:48,120 --> 01:29:50,000
<font color="#ffff00">Let's use the furniture.</font>

1139
01:29:50,000 --> 01:29:54,000
<font color="#00ffff">Right, let's put that bunk</font>
<font color="#00ffff">up against the door.</font><font color="#ffff00"> OK.</font>

1140
01:29:54,000 --> 01:29:56,560
<font color="#ffff00">What about the wardrobe</font>
<font color="#ffff00">over the window?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Good idea!</font>

1141
01:29:56,560 --> 01:29:59,920
<font color="#00ffff">Let's use that and the other bunks</font>
<font color="#00ffff">up against the window.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yeah.</font>

1142
01:30:04,600 --> 01:30:05,800
<font color="#ffff00">OK.</font>

1143
01:30:08,560 --> 01:30:11,440
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, no! Oh, please!</font>

1144
01:30:11,440 --> 01:30:14,920
<font color="#ffffff">Please! Please!</font>

1145
01:30:14,920 --> 01:30:17,080
<font color="#00ff00">Nurse Crane.</font>

1146
01:30:17,080 --> 01:30:21,000
<font color="#00ff00">You've looked after me</font>
<font color="#00ff00">all these years.</font>

1147
01:30:21,000 --> 01:30:23,680
<font color="#00ff00">Almost a mother,</font>

1148
01:30:23,680 --> 01:30:27,040
<font color="#00ff00">treating me like a child,</font>

1149
01:30:27,040 --> 01:30:30,280
<font color="#00ff00">humiliating me.</font>

1150
01:30:30,280 --> 01:30:33,600
<font color="#00ff00">I feel this is what Doctor Judson</font>
<font color="#00ff00">would have wished.</font>

1151
01:30:33,600 --> 01:30:35,520
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, no!</font>

1152
01:30:35,520 --> 01:30:37,720
<font color="#ffffff">No, please!</font>

1153
01:30:37,720 --> 01:30:39,400
<font color="#ffffff">SHE SCREAMS</font>

1154
01:30:46,520 --> 01:30:49,160
<font color="#00ff00">I'm afraid you've had</font>
<font color="#00ff00">a wasted journey.</font>

1155
01:30:49,160 --> 01:30:50,400
<font color="#00ffff">Argh!</font>

1156
01:30:51,520 --> 01:30:54,040
<font color="#00ff00">But then, you were never really</font>
<font color="#00ff00">our allies, were you?</font>

1157
01:30:54,040 --> 01:30:57,040
<font color="#00ff00">Your people will always be</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the enemy.</font>

1158
01:30:57,040 --> 01:30:59,000
<font color="#00ffff">See you in hell!</font>

1159
01:31:22,880 --> 01:31:26,040
<font color="#ffff00">I don't like dark buildings.</font>

1160
01:31:26,040 --> 01:31:29,040
<font color="#ffff00">There was one in Perivale.</font>

1161
01:31:29,040 --> 01:31:31,440
<font color="#ffff00">Old, empty house.</font>

1162
01:31:31,440 --> 01:31:34,160
<font color="#ffff00">Full of noises.</font>

1163
01:31:34,160 --> 01:31:36,000
<font color="#ffff00">Evil.</font>

1164
01:31:36,000 --> 01:31:37,840
<font color="#ffff00">Things I didn't understand.</font>

1165
01:31:39,000 --> 01:31:41,000
<font color="#ffff00">Undercurrents.</font>

1166
01:31:43,360 --> 01:31:46,680
<font color="#00ffff">What kind of a world is this</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to bring up a child in?</font>

1167
01:31:49,080 --> 01:31:50,200
<font color="#ffffff">THEY SHRIEK</font>

1168
01:31:53,360 --> 01:31:54,840
<font color="#ffff00">Quick! The window!</font>

1169
01:31:59,240 --> 01:32:02,400
<font color="#00ffff">Ace, take Audrey!</font>

1170
01:32:02,400 --> 01:32:03,760
<font color="#ffff00">Quick!</font>

1171
01:32:10,840 --> 01:32:14,040
<font color="#ffff00">Get in, quick!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Right!</font>

1172
01:32:16,200 --> 01:32:19,040
<font color="#00ffff">What shall I do? What shall I do?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Go to London!</font>

1173
01:32:19,040 --> 01:32:21,480
<font color="#ffff00">My nan will look after you.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Where?</font><font color="#ffff00"> She lives in Streatham.</font>

1174
01:32:21,480 --> 01:32:25,720
<font color="#ffff00">17 Old Terrace! Say it!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">17 Old Terrace.</font>

1175
01:32:25,720 --> 01:32:28,920
<font color="#00ffff">Wait, Ace, I want you to have this.</font>

1176
01:32:28,920 --> 01:32:30,720
<font color="#ffff00">I'll always love you.</font>

1177
01:32:32,240 --> 01:32:33,680
<font color="#ffff00">Now, go!</font>

1178
01:32:35,520 --> 01:32:40,240
<font color="#ffff00">17 Old Terrace!</font><font color="#00ffff"> 17 Old Terrace.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">17 Old Terrace.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Now, go!</font>

1179
01:32:40,240 --> 01:32:41,640
<font color="#ffff00">GO!</font>

1180
01:32:58,840 --> 01:33:02,040
<font color="#ffffff">No, that's not right!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It was so long ago.</font>

1181
01:33:02,040 --> 01:33:03,240
<font color="#ffffff">Erm...</font>

1182
01:33:05,920 --> 01:33:07,720
<font color="#ffffff">There.</font>

1183
01:33:07,720 --> 01:33:10,760
<font color="#ffffff">THUNDER RUMBLES</font>

1184
01:33:12,960 --> 01:33:16,600
<font color="#00ffff">The Time Lord has made his move.</font>

1185
01:33:16,600 --> 01:33:19,040
<font color="#00ffff">Take the poison.</font>

1186
01:33:19,040 --> 01:33:22,000
<font color="#00ffff">Carry it to the ocean.</font>

1187
01:33:22,000 --> 01:33:25,000
<font color="#00ffff">Release it into the waters.</font>

1188
01:33:25,000 --> 01:33:28,840
<font color="#00ff00">And the other Haemovores?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, yes, they've been so useful.</font>

1189
01:33:30,480 --> 01:33:33,720
<font color="#00ffff">How could we have managed</font>
<font color="#00ffff">without them?</font>

1190
01:33:33,720 --> 01:33:35,720
<font color="#00ffff">You know how to kill them.</font>

1191
01:33:43,880 --> 01:33:47,520
<font color="#ffffff">AGONISED SCREAMING</font>

1192
01:34:22,440 --> 01:34:25,400
<font color="#00ffff">Where is the game, Time Lord?</font>

1193
01:34:25,400 --> 01:34:29,680
<font color="#ffffff">You couldn't resist it, could you?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The game of traps.</font>

1194
01:34:31,600 --> 01:34:34,080
<font color="#ffffff">The contest as before.</font>

1195
01:34:34,080 --> 01:34:36,000
<font color="#ffffff">One move.</font>

1196
01:34:36,000 --> 01:34:39,000
<font color="#ffffff">Find the winning move.</font>

1197
01:34:39,000 --> 01:34:41,200
<font color="#ffffff">Spring the trap on me.</font>

1198
01:34:42,560 --> 01:34:44,360
<font color="#ffffff">If you can.</font>

1199
01:34:58,280 --> 01:35:01,240
<font color="#00ff00">Are you going to use that gun?</font>

1200
01:35:01,240 --> 01:35:03,480
<font color="#00ff00">You know your problem,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Captain Bates?</font>

1201
01:35:03,480 --> 01:35:05,640
<font color="#00ff00">You don't know who the enemy is.</font>

1202
01:35:05,640 --> 01:35:09,400
<font color="#00ff00">A traitor is someone</font>
<font color="#00ff00">who doesn't know who the enemy is.</font>

1203
01:35:09,400 --> 01:35:10,440
<font color="#ffffff">SINGLE SHOT</font>

1204
01:35:15,160 --> 01:35:16,920
<font color="#ffffff">But I do.</font>

1205
01:35:18,520 --> 01:35:21,320
<font color="#00ffff">Who... Who is it?</font>

1206
01:35:21,320 --> 01:35:24,080
<font color="#00ffff">Is that you, Time Lord?</font>

1207
01:35:26,880 --> 01:35:30,400
<font color="#00ffff">Tell me the solution.</font>

1208
01:35:30,400 --> 01:35:34,720
<font color="#00ffff">The con... The contest is...</font>
<font color="#00ffff">is too much...</font>

1209
01:35:34,720 --> 01:35:36,880
<font color="#00ffff">..for such a weak body.</font>

1210
01:35:36,880 --> 01:35:40,280
<font color="#ffff00">I...I don't know the solution.</font>

1211
01:35:40,280 --> 01:35:41,760
<font color="#00ffff">Tell me...</font>

1212
01:35:41,760 --> 01:35:44,640
<font color="#00ffff">Tell me the solution!</font>

1213
01:35:48,640 --> 01:35:52,680
<font color="#ffffff">I've been waiting.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">You know me?</font>

1214
01:35:52,680 --> 01:35:56,720
<font color="#ffffff">Thousands of years in the future,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the Earth lies dying,</font>

1215
01:35:56,720 --> 01:35:59,120
<font color="#ffffff">the surface just a chemical slime.</font>

1216
01:35:59,120 --> 01:36:02,560
<font color="#ffffff">Half a million</font>
<font color="#ffffff">years of industrial progress.</font>

1217
01:36:02,560 --> 01:36:06,440
<font color="#00ff00">I am the last.</font>

1218
01:36:06,440 --> 01:36:08,560
<font color="#00ff00">The last living creature on Earth.</font>

1219
01:36:08,560 --> 01:36:12,840
<font color="#00ff00">I watched my world dying</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in the chemicals,</font>

1220
01:36:12,840 --> 01:36:15,000
<font color="#00ff00">and I could do nothing.</font>

1221
01:36:15,000 --> 01:36:18,800
<font color="#00ff00">My world...is dead.</font>

1222
01:36:19,880 --> 01:36:21,360
<font color="#00ffff">I owe you one.</font>

1223
01:36:22,440 --> 01:36:25,320
<font color="#ffff00">What's happened? Are you all right?</font>

1224
01:36:25,320 --> 01:36:29,200
<font color="#00ffff">We're all right now.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">We're fighting together now.</font>

1225
01:36:29,200 --> 01:36:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">War. A game played by politicians.</font>

1226
01:36:33,040 --> 01:36:35,720
<font color="#ffffff">We were just pawns in the game.</font>

1227
01:36:35,720 --> 01:36:38,720
<font color="#ffffff">But the pawns are fighting.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Together now.</font>

1228
01:36:38,720 --> 01:36:41,040
<font color="#ffffff">Eh, comrade?</font><font color="#ffff00"> That's it.</font>

1229
01:36:41,040 --> 01:36:43,520
<font color="#ffff00">The solution. The winning move!</font>

1230
01:36:54,000 --> 01:36:56,400
<font color="#00ffff">Where have you been?</font>

1231
01:36:56,400 --> 01:36:58,280
<font color="#00ff00">It's time to die, Fenric.</font>

1232
01:36:58,280 --> 01:37:01,000
<font color="#00ffff">You don't understand.</font>

1233
01:37:01,000 --> 01:37:05,240
<font color="#00ffff">You don't know why you were</font>
<font color="#00ffff">selected for this mission.</font>

1234
01:37:05,240 --> 01:37:09,040
<font color="#00ff00">Because I speak English.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">My grandmother was English.</font>

1235
01:37:09,040 --> 01:37:11,000
<font color="#00ffff">Emily Wilson.</font>

1236
01:37:11,000 --> 01:37:14,680
<font color="#00ffff">Granddaughter of Joseph Sundvik.</font>

1237
01:37:14,680 --> 01:37:17,000
<font color="#00ffff">You are touched</font>

1238
01:37:17,000 --> 01:37:19,440
<font color="#00ffff">by the Curse of Fenric.</font>

1239
01:37:19,440 --> 01:37:21,160
<font color="#00ffff">I selected you.</font>

1240
01:37:22,720 --> 01:37:26,840
<font color="#00ffff">You are one</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of the Wolves...of Fenric.</font>

1241
01:37:33,000 --> 01:37:34,480
<font color="#ffffff">You're very patient.</font>

1242
01:37:34,480 --> 01:37:37,320
<font color="#ffffff">Carried back thousands</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of years in a time storm</font>

1243
01:37:37,320 --> 01:37:40,800
<font color="#ffffff">to 9th century Transylvania,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and then waiting till now.</font>

1244
01:37:40,800 --> 01:37:44,320
<font color="#00ff00">Without the flask, I was trapped.</font>

1245
01:37:44,320 --> 01:37:46,520
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, yes, the flask.</font>

1246
01:37:46,520 --> 01:37:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">I trapped him like an evil genie.</font>

1247
01:37:49,000 --> 01:37:52,520
<font color="#00ff00">Only he can return me to the future.</font>

1248
01:37:52,520 --> 01:37:55,800
<font color="#ffffff">And so, like a faithful servant,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you follow the flask.</font>

1249
01:37:55,800 --> 01:37:59,920
<font color="#00ff00">A merchant bought it</font>
<font color="#00ff00">from Constantinople.</font>

1250
01:37:59,920 --> 01:38:02,200
<font color="#00ff00">I followed him through Europe.</font>

1251
01:38:02,200 --> 01:38:06,000
<font color="#00ff00">I followed the Viking pirates</font>
<font color="#00ff00">who stole it,</font>

1252
01:38:06,000 --> 01:38:08,200
<font color="#00ff00">and I followed it here.</font>

1253
01:38:08,200 --> 01:38:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">Another of Fenric's games.</font>

1254
01:38:11,280 --> 01:38:13,520
<font color="#ffffff">He carries you back in a time storm</font>

1255
01:38:13,520 --> 01:38:19,000
<font color="#ffffff">to destroy the Earth's water with</font>
<font color="#ffffff">chemicals, to destroy YOUR future.</font>

1256
01:38:19,000 --> 01:38:20,400
<font color="#ffffff">Think on it.</font>

1257
01:38:20,400 --> 01:38:25,040
<font color="#ffffff">Your Earth, your world,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">dying of a chemical slime.</font>

1258
01:38:25,040 --> 01:38:28,720
<font color="#ffffff">This act will be the beginning</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of your end.</font>

1259
01:38:31,640 --> 01:38:33,560
<font color="#00ffff">Are you sure you can stand?</font>

1260
01:38:33,560 --> 01:38:36,000
<font color="#ffffff">Workers of the world, unite.</font>

1261
01:38:36,000 --> 01:38:37,200
<font color="#ffffff">Comrade?</font>

1262
01:38:40,280 --> 01:38:43,680
<font color="#ffff00">Fenric would never have guessed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the solution anyway.</font>

1263
01:38:43,680 --> 01:38:46,280
<font color="#00ff00">Tell me, tovarich...</font>
<font color="#ffff00">A brilliant move.</font>

1264
01:38:46,280 --> 01:38:50,720
<font color="#ffff00">The black and white pawns don't</font>
<font color="#ffff00">fight each other. They join forces.</font>

1265
01:38:57,960 --> 01:39:00,200
<font color="#00ff00">Thank you...</font>

1266
01:39:00,200 --> 01:39:02,760
<font color="#00ff00">..child.</font>

1267
01:39:02,760 --> 01:39:04,280
<font color="#ffffff">ACE!</font>

1268
01:39:10,320 --> 01:39:13,680
<font color="#00ff00">Black...wins...</font>

1269
01:39:15,760 --> 01:39:17,360
<font color="#00ff00">..Time Lord.</font>

1270
01:39:25,200 --> 01:39:26,960
<font color="#ffff00">What's happened?!</font>

1271
01:39:28,440 --> 01:39:31,600
<font color="#00ff00">The Wolves of Fenric,</font>

1272
01:39:31,600 --> 01:39:35,080
<font color="#00ff00">descendants of the Viking</font>
<font color="#00ff00">who first buried the flask...</font>

1273
01:39:37,680 --> 01:39:40,040
<font color="#00ff00">..all pawns in my game.</font>

1274
01:39:42,000 --> 01:39:44,200
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor Judson.</font>

1275
01:39:44,200 --> 01:39:46,800
<font color="#00ff00">Commander Millington.</font>

1276
01:39:46,800 --> 01:39:48,600
<font color="#00ff00">The Ancient One.</font>

1277
01:39:48,600 --> 01:39:51,080
<font color="#00ff00">Captain Sorin.</font>

1278
01:39:52,320 --> 01:39:54,360
<font color="#00ff00">And now you.</font>

1279
01:39:54,360 --> 01:39:55,840
<font color="#ffff00">Me?</font>

1280
01:39:57,400 --> 01:40:01,000
<font color="#ffff00">You can't! How?</font>

1281
01:40:01,000 --> 01:40:02,480
<font color="#00ff00">The baby.</font>

1282
01:40:05,280 --> 01:40:09,160
<font color="#00ff00">In 30 years, the baby will be grown.</font>

1283
01:40:09,160 --> 01:40:10,840
<font color="#00ff00">She will have a daughter.</font>

1284
01:40:10,840 --> 01:40:14,560
<font color="#00ff00">That daughter...will be you.</font>

1285
01:40:16,640 --> 01:40:19,600
<font color="#00ff00">You've just created your own future.</font>

1286
01:40:25,000 --> 01:40:28,160
<font color="#00ff00">The baby is your mother.</font>

1287
01:40:30,000 --> 01:40:34,000
<font color="#00ff00">The mother...you hate.</font>

1288
01:40:36,520 --> 01:40:39,400
<font color="#00ffff">Ace, I want you to have this!</font>

1289
01:40:39,400 --> 01:40:40,760
<font color="#ffff00">I'll always love you.</font>

1290
01:40:40,760 --> 01:40:42,880
<font color="#ffffff">BABY CRIES</font>

1291
01:40:42,880 --> 01:40:45,040
<font color="#ffff00">Now, go!</font>

1292
01:40:48,560 --> 01:40:50,040
<font color="#00ff00">Kill them.</font>

1293
01:40:52,000 --> 01:40:53,320
<font color="#00ff00">Slowly.</font>

1294
01:40:54,680 --> 01:40:57,560
<font color="#ffff00">You don't stand a chance.</font>

1295
01:40:57,560 --> 01:40:59,280
<font color="#ffff00">Tell him, Doctor.</font>

1296
01:40:59,280 --> 01:41:02,840
<font color="#ffff00">He's got it wrong.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">The Time Lord has failed.</font>

1297
01:41:04,240 --> 01:41:07,760
<font color="#00ff00">The Wolves of Fenric</font>
<font color="#00ff00">have released me.</font>

1298
01:41:07,760 --> 01:41:10,760
<font color="#ffff00">The Doctor never fails.</font>

1299
01:41:10,760 --> 01:41:14,360
<font color="#ffff00">I've got faith in him.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Complete faith.</font>

1300
01:41:16,520 --> 01:41:18,560
<font color="#00ff00">Kill them.</font>

1301
01:41:24,360 --> 01:41:27,480
<font color="#ffffff">It can't penetrate</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Ace's psychic force.</font>

1302
01:41:29,640 --> 01:41:32,920
<font color="#00ff00">Time for the one final game, then.</font>

1303
01:41:36,360 --> 01:41:39,720
<font color="#00ff00">The choice is yours, Time Lord.</font>

1304
01:41:39,720 --> 01:41:42,480
<font color="#00ff00">I shall kill you anyway.</font>

1305
01:41:42,480 --> 01:41:45,600
<font color="#00ff00">But if you would like</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the girl to live...</font>

1306
01:41:48,080 --> 01:41:50,840
<font color="#00ff00">..kneel before me.</font>

1307
01:41:53,880 --> 01:41:57,040
<font color="#ffff00">I believe in you, Professor.</font>

1308
01:41:57,040 --> 01:41:59,400
<font color="#00ff00">Kneel if you want the girl to live!</font>

1309
01:42:01,960 --> 01:42:03,360
<font color="#ffffff">Kill her.</font>

1310
01:42:04,600 --> 01:42:06,080
<font color="#ffffff">HE LAUGHS</font>

1311
01:42:08,040 --> 01:42:11,680
<font color="#00ff00">The Time Lord finally understands.</font>

1312
01:42:11,680 --> 01:42:13,680
<font color="#ffffff">Do you think I didn't know?</font>

1313
01:42:13,680 --> 01:42:18,120
<font color="#ffffff">The chess set</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in Lady Peinforte's study? I knew.</font>

1314
01:42:19,520 --> 01:42:22,640
<font color="#00ff00">Earlier than that, Time Lord.</font>

1315
01:42:22,640 --> 01:42:25,000
<font color="#00ff00">Before Cybermen.</font>

1316
01:42:25,000 --> 01:42:27,360
<font color="#00ff00">Ever since Iceworld,</font>

1317
01:42:27,360 --> 01:42:29,840
<font color="#00ff00">where you first met the girl.</font>

1318
01:42:29,840 --> 01:42:34,320
<font color="#ffffff">I knew. I knew she carried</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the evil inside her.</font>

1319
01:42:34,320 --> 01:42:37,760
<font color="#ffffff">Think I'd have chosen</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a social misfit if I hadn't known?</font>

1320
01:42:37,760 --> 01:42:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">She couldn't even pass</font>
<font color="#ffffff">her chemistry exams at school</font>

1321
01:42:39,960 --> 01:42:42,640
<font color="#ffffff">and yet she manages to create</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a time storm in her bedroom.</font>

1322
01:42:42,640 --> 01:42:45,640
<font color="#ffffff">I saw your hand in it</font>
<font color="#ffffff">from the very beginning.</font>

1323
01:42:45,640 --> 01:42:47,040
<font color="#ffffff">SORIN LAUGHS</font>

1324
01:42:47,040 --> 01:42:51,000
<font color="#ffff00">No...</font><font color="#ffffff"> She's an emotional cripple.</font>

1325
01:42:51,000 --> 01:42:54,320
<font color="#ffffff">I wouldn't waste my time on her,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">unless I had to use her somehow.</font>

1326
01:42:54,320 --> 01:42:55,800
<font color="#ffff00">NO!</font>

1327
01:42:58,680 --> 01:42:59,840
<font color="#00ff00">Kill them.</font>

1328
01:43:06,960 --> 01:43:09,000
<font color="#00ff00">Kill them! Do you hear me?</font>

1329
01:43:12,680 --> 01:43:18,000
<font color="#00ff00">No... I command you!</font>

1330
01:43:18,000 --> 01:43:20,280
<font color="#00ff00">No... No!</font>

1331
01:43:20,280 --> 01:43:21,960
<font color="#00ff00">No!</font>

1332
01:43:33,720 --> 01:43:35,600
<font color="#ffffff">Come on! It's over!</font>

1333
01:43:35,600 --> 01:43:39,040
<font color="#ffff00">Leave me alone!</font><font color="#ffffff"> We've got to</font>
<font color="#ffffff">get out of here!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Leave me alone!</font>

1334
01:43:51,920 --> 01:43:54,640
<font color="#ffff00">Couldn't even pass a chemistry exam!</font>

1335
01:43:55,920 --> 01:43:58,320
<font color="#ffffff">I'd have done anything</font>
<font color="#ffffff">not to hurt you,</font>

1336
01:43:58,320 --> 01:44:01,400
<font color="#ffffff">but I had to save you</font>
<font color="#ffffff">from Fenric's evil curse.</font>

1337
01:44:01,400 --> 01:44:04,520
<font color="#ffffff">Your faith in me</font>
<font color="#ffffff">was holding the Haemovore back.</font>

1338
01:44:04,520 --> 01:44:09,000
<font color="#ffff00">You said I was an emotional cripple,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a social misfit!</font>

1339
01:44:09,000 --> 01:44:11,960
<font color="#ffffff">I had to make you lose</font>
<font color="#ffffff">your belief in me.</font>

1340
01:44:11,960 --> 01:44:15,200
<font color="#ffff00">Full marks for teenage psychology.</font>

1341
01:44:15,200 --> 01:44:17,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's not true, believe me.</font>

1342
01:44:23,560 --> 01:44:26,200
<font color="#ffff00">I don't love her!</font>

1343
01:44:26,200 --> 01:44:29,120
<font color="#ffff00">She's my mum, and I don't love her!</font>

1344
01:44:31,720 --> 01:44:34,440
<font color="#ffff00">What's wrong with me?</font>

1345
01:44:34,440 --> 01:44:38,000
<font color="#ffff00">Why can't I stop hating her?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">You loved the baby.</font>

1346
01:44:38,000 --> 01:44:41,400
<font color="#ffff00">But I didn't know she was my mum!</font>

1347
01:44:41,400 --> 01:44:45,560
<font color="#ffffff">Love and hate. Frightening feelings.</font>

1348
01:44:45,560 --> 01:44:48,640
<font color="#ffffff">Especially when they're trapped,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">struggling beneath the surface.</font>

1349
01:44:58,040 --> 01:45:00,160
<font color="#ffffff">Don't be frightened of the water.</font>

1350
01:45:06,480 --> 01:45:09,320
<font color="#00ffff">Audrey... It's all right, darling.</font>

1351
01:45:09,320 --> 01:45:11,600
<font color="#ffffff">BABY CRIES</font>

1352
01:45:09,320 --> 01:45:11,600
<font color="#00ffff">It's all right.</font>

1353
01:45:11,600 --> 01:45:14,520
<font color="#ffffff">ECHOING:</font><font color="#ffff00"> I'll always love you...</font>
<font color="#ffff00">always love you...always love you.</font>

1354
01:45:14,520 --> 01:45:20,000
<font color="#ffffff">ECHOING:</font><font color="#00ffff"> It's all right, darling.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'll always love you.</font>

1355
01:45:29,080 --> 01:45:31,400
<font color="#ffff00">I'm not scared now.</font>

1356
01:45:42,320 --> 01:45:44,000
<font color="#ffffff">Nyet.</font>

1357
01:45:44,000 --> 01:45:46,040
<font color="#ffffff">THEY LAUGH</font>

1358
01:45:48,040 --> 01:45:50,640
<font color="#ffffff">We never talked about it.</font>

1359
01:45:50,640 --> 01:45:52,640
<font color="#ffffff">What happened that day.</font>

1360
01:45:52,640 --> 01:45:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">Hmm. It was all my fault.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I was always on the run.</font>

1361
01:45:57,000 --> 01:45:59,440
<font color="#ffffff">Always eager for the next adventure.</font>

1362
01:45:59,440 --> 01:46:03,520
<font color="#ffff00">Hmm, wasn't just you.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">That was my life.</font>

1363
01:46:03,520 --> 01:46:07,360
<font color="#ffff00">Keeping my head down,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">bottling things up inside.</font>

1364
01:46:07,360 --> 01:46:08,640
<font color="#ffffff">SHE EXHALES</font>

1365
01:46:08,640 --> 01:46:10,920
<font color="#ffff00">Maybe if we'd talked,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">we wouldn't have fallen out.</font>

1366
01:46:10,920 --> 01:46:14,600
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, well,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I did things I'm not proud of.</font>

1367
01:46:14,600 --> 01:46:19,920
<font color="#ffffff">I used you, manipulated you,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">kept secrets.</font>

1368
01:46:19,920 --> 01:46:21,960
<font color="#ffffff">No wonder you abandoned ship.</font>

1369
01:46:21,960 --> 01:46:23,920
<font color="#ffff00">Walked off in a strop, you mean.</font>

1370
01:46:25,160 --> 01:46:28,920
<font color="#ffff00">Cos I just kept seeing their faces.</font>

1371
01:46:28,920 --> 01:46:32,040
<font color="#ffff00">Sorin and Mike.</font>

1372
01:46:32,040 --> 01:46:35,000
<font color="#ffff00">Kara and Bellboy.</font>

1373
01:46:35,000 --> 01:46:38,720
<font color="#ffff00">So many people died for us.</font>

1374
01:46:40,560 --> 01:46:42,760
<font color="#ffff00">I needed someone to blame.</font>

1375
01:46:45,000 --> 01:46:49,400
<font color="#ffff00">By the way, that wasn't West London</font>
<font color="#ffff00">where you dropped me off.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Really?</font>

1376
01:46:49,400 --> 01:46:51,760
<font color="#ffff00">No! It was London, Ontario.</font>

1377
01:46:51,760 --> 01:46:53,280
<font color="#ffffff">HE LAUGHS</font>

1378
01:46:53,280 --> 01:46:56,080
<font color="#ffff00">Had a right palaver getting home</font>
<font color="#ffff00">without a passport.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oops!</font>

1379
01:46:56,080 --> 01:46:59,440
<font color="#ffffff">Well, erm, well, to be fair,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">we did have a very busy day,</font>

1380
01:46:59,440 --> 01:47:05,040
<font color="#ffffff">as I remember. Yes. Oh, yes.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The Rani was up to her old tricks.</font>

1381
01:47:05,040 --> 01:47:09,000
<font color="#ffff00">I'm sorry I left you like that.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">No, but you had to go.</font>

1382
01:47:09,000 --> 01:47:11,440
<font color="#ffffff">To become the person you are today.</font>

1383
01:47:11,440 --> 01:47:14,200
<font color="#ffffff">To save the world.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">That is your destiny.</font>

1384
01:47:14,200 --> 01:47:17,080
<font color="#ffffff">That you set in motion.</font>

1385
01:47:18,800 --> 01:47:21,240
<font color="#ffff00">I went back to see her.</font>

1386
01:47:21,240 --> 01:47:25,320
<font color="#ffff00">Kathleen Dudman. My nan.</font>

1387
01:47:25,320 --> 01:47:30,280
<font color="#ffff00">After I left you I went</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to the care home every Tuesday.</font>

1388
01:47:32,120 --> 01:47:35,440
<font color="#ffff00">She never said much.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">She was so ill.</font>

1389
01:47:35,440 --> 01:47:39,160
<font color="#ffff00">We just sat together, holding hands.</font>

1390
01:47:40,520 --> 01:47:43,000
<font color="#ffff00">But before she died,</font>

1391
01:47:43,000 --> 01:47:45,760
<font color="#ffff00">I think there was this moment</font>

1392
01:47:45,760 --> 01:47:47,960
<font color="#ffff00">where she realised</font>

1393
01:47:47,960 --> 01:47:50,040
<font color="#ffff00">who I was.</font>

1394
01:47:51,720 --> 01:47:54,440
<font color="#ffff00">How we'd met before,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">when she was young.</font>

1395
01:47:55,840 --> 01:47:57,920
<font color="#ffff00">And her eyes changed.</font>

1396
01:47:57,920 --> 01:48:00,360
<font color="#ffff00">They sparkled.</font>

1397
01:48:00,360 --> 01:48:03,720
<font color="#ffff00">And she smiled</font>
<font color="#ffff00">like she'd never smiled before.</font>

1398
01:48:05,160 --> 01:48:06,680
<font color="#ffff00">Like she knew.</font>

1399
01:48:14,560 --> 01:48:20,040
<font color="#ffffff">She would have been very proud</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of everything you have achieved.</font>

1400
01:48:20,040 --> 01:48:24,960
<font color="#ffff00">You know about that?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes, well,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I check in from time to time.</font>

1401
01:48:24,960 --> 01:48:27,880
<font color="#ffffff">And do you want to know a secret?</font>

1402
01:48:27,880 --> 01:48:30,480
<font color="#ffffff">The best is yet to come.</font>

1403
01:48:33,000 --> 01:48:35,000
<font color="#ffff00">I loved you, you know.</font>

1404
01:48:35,000 --> 01:48:37,720
<font color="#ffff00">Like the dad I never had.</font>

1405
01:48:37,720 --> 01:48:40,840
<font color="#ffff00">I've never said that before,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">but I did.</font>

1406
01:48:42,560 --> 01:48:44,200
<font color="#ffff00">I still do.</font>

1407
01:48:46,560 --> 01:48:48,840
<font color="#ffffff">And I love you.</font>

1408
01:48:54,000 --> 01:48:57,040
<font color="#ffff00">We made a great team.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We were wicked!</font>

1409
01:48:59,640 --> 01:49:03,920
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, by the way,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">where is that jacket of yours?</font>

1410
01:49:03,920 --> 01:49:07,480
<font color="#ffff00">Oh. On a hanger in my office.</font>

1411
01:49:07,480 --> 01:49:10,600
<font color="#ffff00">Pride of place,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">but officially retired.</font>

1412
01:49:10,600 --> 01:49:13,640
<font color="#ffffff">Hmm.</font><font color="#ffff00"> I think it's time to grow up.</font>

1413
01:49:14,960 --> 01:49:18,680
<font color="#ffff00">Does this thing fly?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Of course it does.</font>

1414
01:49:18,680 --> 01:49:21,560
<font color="#ffff00">How about a trip</font>
<font color="#ffff00">for old times' sake?</font>

1415
01:49:21,560 --> 01:49:24,320
<font color="#ffffff">Where do you want to go?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I don't know.</font>

1416
01:49:24,320 --> 01:49:26,840
<font color="#ffff00">Anywhere. Everywhere.</font>

1417
01:49:28,040 --> 01:49:32,680
<font color="#ffffff">IMITATES HIM:</font><font color="#ffff00"> Somewhere there's</font>
<font color="#ffff00">danger. Somewhere there's injustice.</font>

1418
01:49:32,680 --> 01:49:35,360
<font color="#ffffff">And somewhere else</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the tea's getting cold.</font>

1419
01:49:35,360 --> 01:49:38,240
<font color="#ffff00">Come on, Professor,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">we've got work to do.</font>

1420
01:49:38,240 --> 01:49:39,440
<font color="#ffffff">Ah!</font>

1421
01:49:39,440 --> 01:49:42,040
<font color="#ffffff">BEEPING AND HUMMING</font>

1422
01:49:46,880 --> 01:49:48,520
<font color="#ffffff">VWORP! VWORP!</font>

1423
01:49:48,520 --> 01:49:50,840
<font color="#ffffff">BEEPING</font>

1424
01:50:17,440 --> 01:50:18,480
<font color="#ffffff">Ow!</font>

1425
01:50:18,480 --> 01:50:22,040
<font color="#ffffff">VWORP! VWORP!</font>

